(4067541, 583204, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you came to your senses and entered this. :P  It''s beautiful, with wonderful contrasts and lighting.  The composition is spot on, too.  And, of course, you got that very nice painterly look.  Just wish I could vote on it!</td>', 'I''m glad you came to your senses and entered this. :P  It''s beautiful, with wonderful contrasts and lighting.  The composition is spot on, too.  And, of course, you got that very nice painterly look.  Just wish I could vote on it!', '2007-09-07 01:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4067548, 583282, 64670, '<td valign="top">Just really lovely!</td>', 'Just really lovely!', '2007-09-07 01:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
