(4068024, 583342, 43088, '<td valign="top">I really had to look for the hat. I think just the upper right quarter of this image would have been absolutely perfect. The red flowers draw the eye too strongly in that direction.</td>', 'I really had to look for the hat. I think just the upper right quarter of this image would have been absolutely perfect. The red flowers draw the eye too strongly in that direction.', '2007-09-07 03:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
