(4068257, 582957, 83758, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I can see where you are going with this and encourage you to develop the style. The orange/red crescents on the grass I found to distract from the overall effect, but well done... a brave work.</td>', 'Interesting - I can see where you are going with this and encourage you to develop the style. The orange/red crescents on the grass I found to distract from the overall effect, but well done... a brave work.', '2007-09-07 06:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068265, 583208, 83758, '<td valign="top">I like your post production, but I think the subject matter could have been better.</td>', 'I like your post production, but I think the subject matter could have been better.', '2007-09-07 06:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068286, 582790, 83758, '<td valign="top">Nice post production and the subject matter is very much in tune with the impressionists, however I suspect a higher saturation of the sky would have improved it. The horizon running through the central axis along with the heads of the closest two anglers makes for a less than interesting composition. Change the camera angle and I think you would have a really good work.</td>', 'Nice post production and the subject matter is very much in tune with the impressionists, however I suspect a higher saturation of the sky would have improved it. The horizon running through the central axis along with the heads of the closest two anglers makes for a less than interesting composition. Change the camera angle and I think you would have a really good work.', '2007-09-07 07:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068288, 580408, 62187, '<td valign="top">Dang, at first I thought the title was ''Judas Priest'' and I started cracking up seeing a guy playing a cello. Then I realized it was ''Jazz Bassist'' and it was a guy playing a cello. Better job then most in the challenge - good work: 10</td>', 'Dang, at first I thought the title was ''Judas Priest'' and I started cracking up seeing a guy playing a cello. Then I realized it was ''Jazz Bassist'' and it was a guy playing a cello. Better job then most in the challenge - good work: 10', '2007-09-07 07:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068329, 580875, 51538, '<td valign="top">Realism?  Nice image, whatever.</td>', 'Realism?  Nice image, whatever.', '2007-09-07 07:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068333, 583148, 51538, '<td valign="top">Certainly the best I have seen so far in this challenge.  Striking without being gauche and your non use of PS filters helps a lot. 9.</td>', 'Certainly the best I have seen so far in this challenge.  Striking without being gauche and your non use of PS filters helps a lot. 9.', '2007-09-07 07:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
