(4068341, 580803, 51538, '<td valign="top">Effect achieved by software or by non-software technique?  I imagine it would be possible to do this without s/w and that is the way I would prefer...</td>', 'Effect achieved by software or by non-software technique?  I imagine it would be possible to do this without s/w and that is the way I would prefer...', '2007-09-07 07:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
