(4068435, 581620, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I would suggest that the effect is more of a blurred pastel or oil crayon. I also think that the subjects, which appear to be about 10-20 ft away, are too large for the frame in this instance for impressionism sake; but your shot is absolutely great compared to the other shots.</td>', 'I like it, but I would suggest that the effect is more of a blurred pastel or oil crayon. I also think that the subjects, which appear to be about 10-20 ft away, are too large for the frame in this instance for impressionism sake; but your shot is absolutely great compared to the other shots.', '2007-09-07 08:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068440, 583182, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot; very mary cassat; stark lines and shades of blue-white that contrast excellently against that clay pot; perhaps the only criticism is that the composition is a bit busy; but great feel here- and that is the point.</td>', 'Excellent shot; very mary cassat; stark lines and shades of blue-white that contrast excellently against that clay pot; perhaps the only criticism is that the composition is a bit busy; but great feel here- and that is the point.', '2007-09-07 08:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068442, 582677, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the degas look here; absolutely superb flesh protrayal; the back end of the photo is not served well by the slumped head; perhaps there needs to be a bit more element of person in the shot- better and more well defined humanity for the composition. Nice feel though.</td>', 'I love the degas look here; absolutely superb flesh protrayal; the back end of the photo is not served well by the slumped head; perhaps there needs to be a bit more element of person in the shot- better and more well defined humanity for the composition. Nice feel though.', '2007-09-07 08:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068447, 581230, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice composition- falls into the eye candy variety. the flowing light, the path; perhaps a nit pick would be that the elements of composition could be better defined. perhaps a closer element in the frame; Overall it has a beautiful renoir or monet feel to it. Classic impressionist feel.</td>', 'Nice composition- falls into the eye candy variety. the flowing light, the path; perhaps a nit pick would be that the elements of composition could be better defined. perhaps a closer element in the frame; Overall it has a beautiful renoir or monet feel to it. Classic impressionist feel.', '2007-09-07 08:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068449, 583330, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like how you stretch the limit and make a modern feeling impressionist work; I like it alot.</td>', 'I like how you stretch the limit and make a modern feeling impressionist work; I like it alot.', '2007-09-07 08:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4068464, 583094, 12611, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too tight a crop; sorry! but; I love the movement and the face; very well defined; the action is put forth but it the eyes stare. This harkens to the excellent portraits of the impressionist period, where a musician or dancer, or sailor was portrayed in their element. great.</td>', 'Perhaps too tight a crop; sorry! but; I love the movement and the face; very well defined; the action is put forth but it the eyes stare. This harkens to the excellent portraits of the impressionist period, where a musician or dancer, or sailor was portrayed in their element. great.', '2007-09-07 09:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
