(4069024, 583295, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is very "impressionistic" looking to me, but the overall composition is uninteresting to me.  There doesn''t seem to be a rythm of tones (by that I mean it is neither warm or cool).  What could have made it more interesting to me is one dominant rock in the foreground right to balance out the sky.  I do like the smooth water and the reflections.<br/> <br/>My final vote may seem rather high based on my comments, but you have met the challenge well, and the technicals are ok (minus the sky).  6</td>', 'This is very "impressionistic" looking to me, but the overall composition is uninteresting to me.  There doesn''t seem to be a rythm of tones (by that I mean it is neither warm or cool).  What could have made it more interesting to me is one dominant rock in the foreground right to balance out the sky.  I do like the smooth water and the reflections. My final vote may seem rather high based on my comments, but you have met the challenge well, and the technicals are ok (minus the sky).  6', '2007-09-07 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
