(4069146, 583314, 74979, '<td valign="top">lovely image; i  really like her legs &amp; feet doubt anyone could read that way, that would be uncomfortable after awhile LOL!; lighting &amp; tones very good.  overall more of a blur to me than impressionistic in tradtional sense of painting, but this type of pohotgraphy seems to encoompass many interpretations</td>', 'lovely image; i  really like her legs & feet doubt anyone could read that way, that would be uncomfortable after awhile LOL!; lighting & tones very good.  overall more of a blur to me than impressionistic in tradtional sense of painting, but this type of pohotgraphy seems to encoompass many interpretations', '2007-09-07 13:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
