(4069154, 582789, 68256, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastel composition in the tradition of great impressionistic paintings.  Very well done.  I love the layering which gives great debth to the photo.  Great control of the sky too. Maybe adding a foreground object would have increased the debth even more....8</td>', 'Lovely pastel composition in the tradition of great impressionistic paintings.  Very well done.  I love the layering which gives great debth to the photo.  Great control of the sky too. Maybe adding a foreground object would have increased the debth even more....8', '2007-09-07 13:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
