(4072490, 582789, 82817, '<td valign="top">I have spent considerable time looking at this photo and I am compelled to like it. I would like more blueness in the sky but then again it might be distracting to the image and it looks like a cloudy day anyway.</td>', 'I have spent considerable time looking at this photo and I am compelled to like it. I would like more blueness in the sky but then again it might be distracting to the image and it looks like a cloudy day anyway.', '2007-09-08 14:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072494, 583281, 82817, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the filters. I am not a fan of filters but I do like your usage here. The title is wonderful and the main object looks winglike and enhances the title. I am moving you up a bit in ranking.</td>', 'Nice job with the filters. I am not a fan of filters but I do like your usage here. The title is wonderful and the main object looks winglike and enhances the title. I am moving you up a bit in ranking.', '2007-09-08 14:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072500, 581396, 82817, '<td valign="top">Wish there was more color but I do like this.</td>', 'Wish there was more color but I do like this.', '2007-09-08 14:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072506, 583006, 82817, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the title means but I like what you''ve done. The sky is a washed out but not distracting enough to change my vote. I wish more people would comment about what attracts them to vote the way they do.</td>', 'Not sure what the title means but I like what you''ve done. The sky is a washed out but not distracting enough to change my vote. I wish more people would comment about what attracts them to vote the way they do.', '2007-09-08 14:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072519, 583342, 82817, '<td valign="top">I am moving you up a notch, OK two notches,  because of the impressionism era look of your entry. I read through the forum on this challenge and have researched a bit more on impressionism and this really meets the challenge in my eyes. Great job! I think you deserve a 10!</td>', 'I am moving you up a notch, OK two notches,  because of the impressionism era look of your entry. I read through the forum on this challenge and have researched a bit more on impressionism and this really meets the challenge in my eyes. Great job! I think you deserve a 10!', '2007-09-08 14:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072527, 579837, 82817, '<td valign="top">I had the same thought with marigolds in yellow and orange but entered something completly different. I am wishing the filter was applied more lightly but I love the virbrance of colors and the subject matter. I am moving this up a bit.</td>', 'I had the same thought with marigolds in yellow and orange but entered something completly different. I am wishing the filter was applied more lightly but I love the virbrance of colors and the subject matter. I am moving this up a bit.', '2007-09-08 14:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072540, 581442, 82817, '<td valign="top">In revisiting this entry of yours, I am inclined to move up my vote score a bit. I saw some flowers in pink and I think purple that would have been very much like this except I couldn''t wrap my mind around a chain link fence  being impressionism. You have inspired me to look differently at what my mind usually filters out and I applaude you for that. Well done!</td>', 'In revisiting this entry of yours, I am inclined to move up my vote score a bit. I saw some flowers in pink and I think purple that would have been very much like this except I couldn''t wrap my mind around a chain link fence  being impressionism. You have inspired me to look differently at what my mind usually filters out and I applaude you for that. Well done!', '2007-09-08 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072548, 580994, 82817, '<td valign="top">Beautiful play of light and color, I am moving up my vote because it looks painterly. I love movement in photographs and am not a pure sharpness freak when it enhances the look. I hand held my 150mm lens for 1.6 seconds on a very windy day for my entry and love the look and feel even if it is getting panned in the voting. Thanks for your entry.</td>', 'Beautiful play of light and color, I am moving up my vote because it looks painterly. I love movement in photographs and am not a pure sharpness freak when it enhances the look. I hand held my 150mm lens for 1.6 seconds on a very windy day for my entry and love the look and feel even if it is getting panned in the voting. Thanks for your entry.', '2007-09-08 14:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072560, 583336, 82817, '<td valign="top">Just a tad too much movement! The background is amazing, is it painted or, what is it? I know everyone is scared to center an object these days but I would like this a bit more centered as well.</td>', 'Just a tad too much movement! The background is amazing, is it painted or, what is it? I know everyone is scared to center an object these days but I would like this a bit more centered as well.', '2007-09-08 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072561, 581230, 82817, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve done here however the overly bright top center is what keeps me from giving you a higher score. I know you would probably lose detail in the trees to the left and that might be your reasoning for leaving the brightness. It looks like this is done in camera with a bit of movement. Bravo!</td>', 'I like what you''ve done here however the overly bright top center is what keeps me from giving you a higher score. I know you would probably lose detail in the trees to the left and that might be your reasoning for leaving the brightness. It looks like this is done in camera with a bit of movement. Bravo!', '2007-09-08 14:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072564, 581851, 82817, '<td valign="top">You really have a great shot here. This has a very watercolory feel, no pun intended.</td>', 'You really have a great shot here. This has a very watercolory feel, no pun intended.', '2007-09-08 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072566, 583086, 82817, '<td valign="top">This is great subject matter!</td>', 'This is great subject matter!', '2007-09-08 14:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072578, 583186, 82817, '<td valign="top">Looks like a place I used to kayak in Brewster, NY. The Great Swamp. You can look it up on the web. I think the look and personal memories are what drew me to this photo. Thanks</td>', 'Looks like a place I used to kayak in Brewster, NY. The Great Swamp. You can look it up on the web. I think the look and personal memories are what drew me to this photo. Thanks', '2007-09-08 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072580, 581434, 82817, '<td valign="top">I like the wind-like movements.</td>', 'I like the wind-like movements.', '2007-09-08 14:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072594, 583232, 82817, '<td valign="top">I find the filter a bit distracting in a revisit of this entry. It is probably just a tad too much filter for me. I do love the photo and it really looks like an oil painting. Though the elements are different it looks like a painting I attempted back in high school, long, long ago. The colors on the boat are amazing. I stand behind my original scoring.</td>', 'I find the filter a bit distracting in a revisit of this entry. It is probably just a tad too much filter for me. I do love the photo and it really looks like an oil painting. Though the elements are different it looks like a painting I attempted back in high school, long, long ago. The colors on the boat are amazing. I stand behind my original scoring.', '2007-09-08 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072604, 582937, 82817, '<td valign="top">I am sorry to move this down a notch but the tiger throws the entry as subject matter for me. The filter/texture is too heavy for my eyes as well. Love the light!</td>', 'I am sorry to move this down a notch but the tiger throws the entry as subject matter for me. The filter/texture is too heavy for my eyes as well. Love the light!', '2007-09-08 15:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072605, 582245, 82817, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the vibrance in this but I cannot get myself to see it as impressionism. I gave you a good score in spite of it. Plus I am adding your entry to my favorites for amazing color.</td>', 'I love the colors and the vibrance in this but I cannot get myself to see it as impressionism. I gave you a good score in spite of it. Plus I am adding your entry to my favorites for amazing color.', '2007-09-08 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072615, 580938, 82817, '<td valign="top">I''m moving you up a bit in a revisit of your entry. The filter is a bit strong but I love the subject matter and colors.</td>', 'I''m moving you up a bit in a revisit of your entry. The filter is a bit strong but I love the subject matter and colors.', '2007-09-08 15:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072617, 582620, 82817, '<td valign="top">In going through my votes again, I came across your lovely image and now I am really drawn to the brown speck on the rose and I wish it wasn''t there. I am reducing the score slightly. Sorry, this is advanced editing after all. The brown on the outside edge of the petal is not glaring to me and I don''t think it detracts from the image, in fact it lends authenticity.</td>', 'In going through my votes again, I came across your lovely image and now I am really drawn to the brown speck on the rose and I wish it wasn''t there. I am reducing the score slightly. Sorry, this is advanced editing after all. The brown on the outside edge of the petal is not glaring to me and I don''t think it detracts from the image, in fact it lends authenticity.', '2007-09-08 15:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072625, 580860, 82817, '<td valign="top">I cannot tell you what it is, but something just doesn''t quite work.</td>', 'I cannot tell you what it is, but something just doesn''t quite work.', '2007-09-08 15:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072635, 583206, 82817, '<td valign="top">The camera movement is a bit much though I do get the sense of impressionism. Moving you up a bit on further review.</td>', 'The camera movement is a bit much though I do get the sense of impressionism. Moving you up a bit on further review.', '2007-09-08 15:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072653, 581382, 82817, '<td valign="top">The colors draw me in but something keeps me from loving it and I don''t know what it is.</td>', 'The colors draw me in but something keeps me from loving it and I don''t know what it is.', '2007-09-08 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072663, 582821, 82817, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors!</td>', 'Fantastic colors!', '2007-09-08 15:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072667, 582064, 82817, '<td valign="top">The bench seems somehow out of place.</td>', 'The bench seems somehow out of place.', '2007-09-08 15:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4072739, 581300, 66310, '<td valign="top">Nice...very nice!! Awesome lighting and colors!</td>', 'Nice...very nice!! Awesome lighting and colors!', '2007-09-08 15:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073075, 580922, 16850, '<td valign="top">To me, this does not meet the challenge</td>', 'To me, this does not meet the challenge', '2007-09-08 20:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073082, 583222, 16850, '<td valign="top">DNMC to me</td>', 'DNMC to me', '2007-09-08 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073084, 581508, 16850, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the filter, but nice color</td>', 'I don''t like the filter, but nice color', '2007-09-08 20:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073086, 581226, 16850, '<td valign="top">too soft for me</td>', 'too soft for me', '2007-09-08 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073089, 582956, 16850, '<td valign="top">WOW! Not sure ir''s impressionism but I AM impressed!</td>', 'WOW! Not sure ir''s impressionism but I AM impressed!', '2007-09-08 20:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073090, 582821, 16850, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lightness but too abstract for me</td>', 'Nice color and lightness but too abstract for me', '2007-09-08 20:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073093, 580998, 16850, '<td valign="top">DNMC to me</td>', 'DNMC to me', '2007-09-08 20:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073095, 583292, 16850, '<td valign="top">Too soft and dark for me</td>', 'Too soft and dark for me', '2007-09-08 20:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073099, 582033, 16850, '<td valign="top">I feel this would benefit with a larger scope and is too dark and heavy for impressionism.</td>', 'I feel this would benefit with a larger scope and is too dark and heavy for impressionism.', '2007-09-08 20:13:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4073103, 580541, 16850, '<td valign="top">too soft for me</td>', 'too soft for me', '2007-09-08 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073105, 582017, 49773, '<td valign="top">DKMRancidNOFX</td>', 'DKMRancidNOFX', '2007-09-08 20:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073218, 582427, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and the geometry is interesting.  7.</td>', 'Very nice idea and the geometry is interesting.  7.', '2007-09-08 21:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073231, 581300, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the slightly shriveled peaches.  The added texture enhances the story.  Being a still life, one becomes critical of composition and placings of objects.  But for me, it works well and looks "genuine."  Perhaps the white cloth is an oddity.  I''m not sure.  The background looks nice.  Is this realist still life in a Dutch sort of way or impressionism.  That question does not really concern me.  I think it is as good an impression as any photo in this challenge and better for not using some sort of gauche software filter to mimic pointillism or brush strokes. 7.</td>', 'I like the slightly shriveled peaches.  The added texture enhances the story.  Being a still life, one becomes critical of composition and placings of objects.  But for me, it works well and looks "genuine."  Perhaps the white cloth is an oddity.  I''m not sure.  The background looks nice.  Is this realist still life in a Dutch sort of way or impressionism.  That question does not really concern me.  I think it is as good an impression as any photo in this challenge and better for not using some sort of gauche software filter to mimic pointillism or brush strokes. 7.', '2007-09-08 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073236, 582785, 51538, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dark objects and lovely characterful decay at the end of summer - with the addition of glorious colour.  You did a good job.  7.</td>', 'Beautiful dark objects and lovely characterful decay at the end of summer - with the addition of glorious colour.  You did a good job.  7.', '2007-09-08 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073240, 582200, 51538, '<td valign="top">The colours and clarity are lovely. The coastline is a natural setting for impressionist work.  I think your photo does the job. 7.</td>', 'The colours and clarity are lovely. The coastline is a natural setting for impressionist work.  I think your photo does the job. 7.', '2007-09-08 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073243, 581496, 51538, '<td valign="top">I rather like the complementing colours and the splash.  Quite exotic. 7.</td>', 'I rather like the complementing colours and the splash.  Quite exotic. 7.', '2007-09-08 21:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073245, 580528, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject and shutter speed.  It works well. 7.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject and shutter speed.  It works well. 7.', '2007-09-08 21:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073246, 583336, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well executed. 7.</td>', 'Nice idea and well executed. 7.', '2007-09-08 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073532, 582187, 82817, '<td valign="top">I really like the texturing but to me the trees in the background the aspens seem to have lost too much of their form. I do like the effect.</td>', 'I really like the texturing but to me the trees in the background the aspens seem to have lost too much of their form. I do like the effect.', '2007-09-08 23:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073537, 582974, 82817, '<td valign="top">The subject matter seems too old west to be impressionism. At least in my opinion. I do like the shot.</td>', 'The subject matter seems too old west to be impressionism. At least in my opinion. I do like the shot.', '2007-09-08 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073544, 581300, 82817, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if it fits the challenge for me. I do like the still life arrangement and photo over-all.</td>', 'I am not sure if it fits the challenge for me. I do like the still life arrangement and photo over-all.', '2007-09-08 23:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073545, 581506, 82817, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit too saturated in the blues.</td>', 'This seems a bit too saturated in the blues.', '2007-09-08 23:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073549, 580273, 82817, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the texture of the water.</td>', 'Love the colors and the texture of the water.', '2007-09-08 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073553, 580926, 82817, '<td valign="top">I like the play of the light on the water.</td>', 'I like the play of the light on the water.', '2007-09-08 23:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073561, 582609, 82817, '<td valign="top">I am not sure of what I should look at here, there doesn''t seem to be a main subject. A tighter crop might have made it work better. It might also be all the backsides are the subject.</td>', 'I am not sure of what I should look at here, there doesn''t seem to be a main subject. A tighter crop might have made it work better. It might also be all the backsides are the subject.', '2007-09-08 23:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073566, 582017, 82817, '<td valign="top">Timely but one kid lost his head in the shadows and the distant sky is washed out.</td>', 'Timely but one kid lost his head in the shadows and the distant sky is washed out.', '2007-09-08 23:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073567, 583075, 82817, '<td valign="top">The texture is too heavy for me. Nice framing.</td>', 'The texture is too heavy for me. Nice framing.', '2007-09-08 23:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073569, 580786, 82817, '<td valign="top">I too thought of using the zoom for this challenge but decided against it.</td>', 'I too thought of using the zoom for this challenge but decided against it.', '2007-09-08 23:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073572, 580586, 82817, '<td valign="top">Might have worked without the texture. The shot is great with the ripples and the colors.</td>', 'Might have worked without the texture. The shot is great with the ripples and the colors.', '2007-09-08 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073577, 580004, 82817, '<td valign="top">Looks to be more expressionism than impressionism. But that is only my opinion. I do think if this were a Van Gogh challenge and you cropped it at the half way point and threw away the now lower half you would win a bright blue ribbon.</td>', 'Looks to be more expressionism than impressionism. But that is only my opinion. I do think if this were a Van Gogh challenge and you cropped it at the half way point and threw away the now lower half you would win a bright blue ribbon.', '2007-09-08 23:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073584, 580455, 82817, '<td valign="top">It might be the colors being really bright that holds me back in my voting but I am not sure what it is.</td>', 'It might be the colors being really bright that holds me back in my voting but I am not sure what it is.', '2007-09-09 00:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073592, 583148, 82817, '<td valign="top">Lose the clear part of the boat with a reflection and I would have gone higher in voting. Bringing you up a bit anyhow.</td>', 'Lose the clear part of the boat with a reflection and I would have gone higher in voting. Bringing you up a bit anyhow.', '2007-09-09 00:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073596, 580777, 82817, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter, the colors seem too saturated.</td>', 'Great subject matter, the colors seem too saturated.', '2007-09-09 00:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073599, 582606, 82817, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop and getting rid of the bright blue on the handlebar would cause me to vote even higher.</td>', 'A tighter crop and getting rid of the bright blue on the handlebar would cause me to vote even higher.', '2007-09-09 00:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073600, 580362, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and impressionistic look</td>', 'Nice colors and impressionistic look', '2007-09-09 00:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073603, 581096, 82817, '<td valign="top">I think it is the high saturation that I am not fond of. Love the colors otherwise.</td>', 'I think it is the high saturation that I am not fond of. Love the colors otherwise.', '2007-09-09 00:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073604, 582922, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice use of ps filter</td>', 'Nice use of ps filter', '2007-09-09 00:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073606, 583098, 82817, '<td valign="top">Like it better this time around. The repeating patterns in the texture are not working for me.</td>', 'Like it better this time around. The repeating patterns in the texture are not working for me.', '2007-09-09 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073608, 582190, 82817, '<td valign="top">Love it as a watercolor.</td>', 'Love it as a watercolor.', '2007-09-09 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073610, 582427, 82817, '<td valign="top">I can''t get past how blue it is. Really overpowers the leaves.</td>', 'I can''t get past how blue it is. Really overpowers the leaves.', '2007-09-09 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073615, 580563, 82817, '<td valign="top">I like it better the second time through. The yellows and greens plus the leafless trees are great. I might have cropped some off the right for blur and some of the top to remove some of the excess white.</td>', 'I like it better the second time through. The yellows and greens plus the leafless trees are great. I might have cropped some off the right for blur and some of the top to remove some of the excess white.', '2007-09-09 00:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073616, 581845, 82817, '<td valign="top">This has the look of "Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte" minus the people. It is however a bit too blurry for me. Lovely light.</td>', 'This has the look of "Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte" minus the people. It is however a bit too blurry for me. Lovely light.', '2007-09-09 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073619, 582531, 82817, '<td valign="top">The trees in the background are really dark and the water is too. Love the birds.</td>', 'The trees in the background are really dark and the water is too. Love the birds.', '2007-09-09 00:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073621, 582425, 82817, '<td valign="top">The bottom half of the photograph really appeals to me and I love the different techniques applied from streaks of color in the reflection to the Pointillism used on the lower right. I would have loved to see a tighter crop of the lower half. Good work.</td>', 'The bottom half of the photograph really appeals to me and I love the different techniques applied from streaks of color in the reflection to the Pointillism used on the lower right. I would have loved to see a tighter crop of the lower half. Good work.', '2007-09-09 00:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073626, 582922, 82817, '<td valign="top">The flowers on the left look like they don''t belong here, they are too sharp compared to the rest of the photo.</td>', 'The flowers on the left look like they don''t belong here, they are too sharp compared to the rest of the photo.', '2007-09-09 00:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073631, 582916, 63503, '<td valign="top">Where did you find this beauty and in the perfect spot for an impressionistic shot? Nice image.</td>', 'Where did you find this beauty and in the perfect spot for an impressionistic shot? Nice image.', '2007-09-09 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073632, 582274, 82817, '<td valign="top">I see not fool nor hill. Love the canvas texture and the muted colors.</td>', 'I see not fool nor hill. Love the canvas texture and the muted colors.', '2007-09-09 00:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073636, 583098, 63503, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2007-09-09 00:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073637, 580961, 82817, '<td valign="top">I bit too wavy for my taste. Great idea.</td>', 'I bit too wavy for my taste. Great idea.', '2007-09-09 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073640, 579965, 82817, '<td valign="top">Beautiful garden. Looks like it could be a cover for Fine Gardening.</td>', 'Beautiful garden. Looks like it could be a cover for Fine Gardening.', '2007-09-09 00:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073643, 583242, 63503, '<td valign="top">Definitely impressionistic, beautiful colors.</td>', 'Definitely impressionistic, beautiful colors.', '2007-09-09 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073646, 582064, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, nice use of filter.</td>', 'Very pretty, nice use of filter.', '2007-09-09 00:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073647, 583269, 82817, '<td valign="top">I like the texture everywhere excepting for the tongue.</td>', 'I like the texture everywhere excepting for the tongue.', '2007-09-09 00:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073648, 582609, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice and relatively subtle use of ps filter</td>', 'Nice and relatively subtle use of ps filter', '2007-09-09 00:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073651, 582906, 82817, '<td valign="top">The dogs work but the I am too distracted by the black and white around them.</td>', 'The dogs work but the I am too distracted by the black and white around them.', '2007-09-09 00:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073653, 582190, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and subject, but I think I would have lieked it better without the blown-out whites.</td>', 'Very nice colors and subject, but I think I would have lieked it better without the blown-out whites.', '2007-09-09 00:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073654, 582592, 82817, '<td valign="top">the texture is really heavy and the colors seem a bit overly saturated.</td>', 'the texture is really heavy and the colors seem a bit overly saturated.', '2007-09-09 00:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073658, 583272, 82817, '<td valign="top">A lighter hand at texturing and Viola!</td>', 'A lighter hand at texturing and Viola!', '2007-09-09 00:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073660, 583120, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice natural frame around the stream and subtle use of filter.</td>', 'Nice natural frame around the stream and subtle use of filter.', '2007-09-09 00:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4073661, 583151, 82817, '<td valign="top">Pixels are overly large in the sky. Great otherwise.</td>', 'Pixels are overly large in the sky. Great otherwise.', '2007-09-09 00:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
