(4074577, 583333, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful softness suits this capture. Colors are great. The one bright spot at top left distracts a bit.</td>', 'Beautiful softness suits this capture. Colors are great. The one bright spot at top left distracts a bit.', '2007-09-09 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074578, 583253, 73250, '<td valign="top">I like this...the lighting is very nice and the pose/composition beautiful.</td>', 'I like this...the lighting is very nice and the pose/composition beautiful.', '2007-09-09 10:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074583, 582017, 73250, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favs...I like the treatment...the subject reminds me of that movie Stand By Me. I would have liked to see the second boy from the left a little bit lighter, more definition.</td>', 'This is one of my favs...I like the treatment...the subject reminds me of that movie Stand By Me. I would have liked to see the second boy from the left a little bit lighter, more definition.', '2007-09-09 10:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074585, 582704, 73250, '<td valign="top">The image is beautiful...I wish there weren''t so much white coming through between the brush strokes.</td>', 'The image is beautiful...I wish there weren''t so much white coming through between the brush strokes.', '2007-09-09 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074586, 583097, 73250, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and I like the ocmp.</td>', 'Beautiful color and I like the ocmp.', '2007-09-09 10:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074590, 581617, 73250, '<td valign="top">This is lovely...I enjoy your interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'This is lovely...I enjoy your interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-09-09 10:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074591, 582956, 73250, '<td valign="top">Very creative...and nice lighting.</td>', 'Very creative...and nice lighting.', '2007-09-09 10:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074592, 579626, 73250, '<td valign="top">I really do like this...very impressionistic. I think I would have preferred a vase in a different color or clear...just because the green in the vaseb is not complimentary to the green in the flower stalks. Well done.</td>', 'I really do like this...very impressionistic. I think I would have preferred a vase in a different color or clear...just because the green in the vaseb is not complimentary to the green in the flower stalks. Well done.', '2007-09-09 10:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074595, 583334, 73250, '<td valign="top">Nice...I like the composition and the reflection.</td>', 'Nice...I like the composition and the reflection.', '2007-09-09 10:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074598, 583218, 73250, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors and nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Vibrant colors and nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-09-09 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074610, 582453, 73250, '<td valign="top">Vibrant colors. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.</td>', 'Vibrant colors. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.', '2007-09-09 10:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074611, 582821, 73250, '<td valign="top">Interesting...but, I am having a hard time distinguishing what I am looking at. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.</td>', 'Interesting...but, I am having a hard time distinguishing what I am looking at. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.', '2007-09-09 10:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074614, 583237, 73250, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and comp. I''m not fond of the pencil drawn look of it. Just my feeling.</td>', 'Nice colors and comp. I''m not fond of the pencil drawn look of it. Just my feeling.', '2007-09-09 10:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074616, 583279, 73250, '<td valign="top">I think that this looks very impressionistic...I''m not fond, however, of the blue path. It doesn''t look natural...the rest of the colors are very nice.</td>', 'I think that this looks very impressionistic...I''m not fond, however, of the blue path. It doesn''t look natural...the rest of the colors are very nice.', '2007-09-09 10:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074620, 582949, 73250, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. I''m not fond of the white flower smack dab in the center. You might have been better off leaving the white one out all together, since you have a white background.</td>', 'This is interesting. I''m not fond of the white flower smack dab in the center. You might have been better off leaving the white one out all together, since you have a white background.', '2007-09-09 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074623, 582985, 73250, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot...the ship gives the feel of the vastness of the water. You lost control of the white in the clouds though...since this is advanced, I would have done some burning to bring back some of that definition.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot...the ship gives the feel of the vastness of the water. You lost control of the white in the clouds though...since this is advanced, I would have done some burning to bring back some of that definition.', '2007-09-09 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074625, 583117, 73250, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and comp. I think you may have been a little heavy handed with the filter...some adjustments would help.</td>', 'I like the subject and comp. I think you may have been a little heavy handed with the filter...some adjustments would help.', '2007-09-09 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074642, 583263, 73250, '<td valign="top">My feeling about impressionism is you are able recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes. This seems a bit oversharpened, the sky is quite lackluster, and the colors (particularly in the trees) are very muted.</td>', 'My feeling about impressionism is you are able recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes. This seems a bit oversharpened, the sky is quite lackluster, and the colors (particularly in the trees) are very muted.', '2007-09-09 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074646, 582777, 73250, '<td valign="top">My feeling about impressionism, is that you are able recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes. You have achieved this...but, it seems a bit overdone. I do like the sky alot.</td>', 'My feeling about impressionism, is that you are able recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes. You have achieved this...but, it seems a bit overdone. I do like the sky alot.', '2007-09-09 10:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074649, 582403, 73250, '<td valign="top">Interesting...but, I am having a hard time distinguishing what the central subject is supposed to be. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.</td>', 'Interesting...but, I am having a hard time distinguishing what the central subject is supposed to be. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.', '2007-09-09 10:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074654, 581845, 73250, '<td valign="top">My feeling about impressionism is that you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes. If you are attempting to use camera blur to create the brush stroke...it needs to be in a specific pattern...not just blur. Blur has no texture.</td>', 'My feeling about impressionism is that you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes. If you are attempting to use camera blur to create the brush stroke...it needs to be in a specific pattern...not just blur. Blur has no texture.', '2007-09-09 10:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074719, 581226, 81362, '<td valign="top">The interplay of light and color recalls impressionist art. I find the part with stronger linear blur (right 1/5 of the photo) seems much more interesting and impressionistic than the parts where the flowers and leaves are easier to identify individually.</td>', 'The interplay of light and color recalls impressionist art. I find the part with stronger linear blur (right 1/5 of the photo) seems much more interesting and impressionistic than the parts where the flowers and leaves are easier to identify individually.', '2007-09-09 11:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074720, 581442, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the flowers and the old garage because both seem timeless. The car tires and chain link fence anchor the image more specifically in time, an unfortunate distraction.</td>', 'I like the flowers and the old garage because both seem timeless. The car tires and chain link fence anchor the image more specifically in time, an unfortunate distraction.', '2007-09-09 11:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074722, 583259, 81362, '<td valign="top">The effect on the hedge and red flowers is nice. I wonder how the image would be if composed with one horse instead of two.</td>', 'The effect on the hedge and red flowers is nice. I wonder how the image would be if composed with one horse instead of two.', '2007-09-09 11:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074723, 580541, 81362, '<td valign="top">When I scroll the screen to crop off the top enough to exclude everything above the initial expanse of water, I find it easier relax and enjoy the impression of a child and a red ball at the shore.</td>', 'When I scroll the screen to crop off the top enough to exclude everything above the initial expanse of water, I find it easier relax and enjoy the impression of a child and a red ball at the shore.', '2007-09-09 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074725, 583330, 81362, '<td valign="top">In this image, the rough backlit bark up close (focused but inherently hard to identify individual elements) contrasts nicely with the blurred bark and greenery in the background. The butterfly backlit against the rough bark is very pretty. I would be interesting to see the same shot and processing without the butterfly, just as a pure impression of light and textures.</td>', 'In this image, the rough backlit bark up close (focused but inherently hard to identify individual elements) contrasts nicely with the blurred bark and greenery in the background. The butterfly backlit against the rough bark is very pretty. I would be interesting to see the same shot and processing without the butterfly, just as a pure impression of light and textures.', '2007-09-09 11:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074729, 582963, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting play on light and color, with the subject remaining identifiable. The impressionist art I have seen focuses on the play of natural light, so I struggle with the role of 60''s black-light poster effects in the setting of this challenge. Point for creativity, counterbalanced by my not liking those posters much in the first place. Then extra point for making me think (a good function for art).</td>', 'Interesting play on light and color, with the subject remaining identifiable. The impressionist art I have seen focuses on the play of natural light, so I struggle with the role of 60''s black-light poster effects in the setting of this challenge. Point for creativity, counterbalanced by my not liking those posters much in the first place. Then extra point for making me think (a good function for art).', '2007-09-09 11:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074733, 583341, 81362, '<td valign="top">Sunflowers are a classic subject for art, and certainly used by impressionists and post-impressionists. The green squiggle on the face of the main flower detracts from the composition. I find myself wishing for brighter yellows, stronger contrast, and a different approach to making it impressionistic, other than a simple blur (whether focus or Gaussian).</td>', 'Sunflowers are a classic subject for art, and certainly used by impressionists and post-impressionists. The green squiggle on the face of the main flower detracts from the composition. I find myself wishing for brighter yellows, stronger contrast, and a different approach to making it impressionistic, other than a simple blur (whether focus or Gaussian).', '2007-09-09 11:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074765, 583295, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, it looks like one of the examples I saw, would  liked to have seen brush strokes, lighting is good.</td>', 'Nice picture, it looks like one of the examples I saw, would  liked to have seen brush strokes, lighting is good.', '2007-09-09 11:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074768, 582937, 73564, '<td valign="top">Good composition, the white is a tad bright, good image.</td>', 'Good composition, the white is a tad bright, good image.', '2007-09-09 11:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074769, 582619, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the trees look good, maybe if the bird weren''t centered, the composition would have been a little better.</td>', 'Nicely done, the trees look good, maybe if the bird weren''t centered, the composition would have been a little better.', '2007-09-09 11:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4074770, 583232, 73564, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, lighting is very nice, not sure on what filter was used, but it looks like noise instaed of brush strokes.</td>', 'Love the composition, lighting is very nice, not sure on what filter was used, but it looks like noise instaed of brush strokes.', '2007-09-09 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
