(4074774, 583062, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice image, not something I''d think to be used in this type of work, the filter/effect used is good, the only thing I don''t really like is the pink haze on the mountains, other than that nicely done, 6.</td>', 'Nice image, not something I''d think to be used in this type of work, the filter/effect used is good, the only thing I don''t really like is the pink haze on the mountains, other than that nicely done, 6.', '2007-09-09 12:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
