(4075133, 582963, 73250, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have known this was a frog had you not put it in the title. This interpretaion of impressionism does not speak to me. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have known this was a frog had you not put it in the title. This interpretaion of impressionism does not speak to me. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.', '2007-09-09 15:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
