(4075139, 581620, 73250, '<td valign="top">Interesting...but, I am having a hard time distinguishing what the central subject is supposed to be. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.</td>', 'Interesting...but, I am having a hard time distinguishing what the central subject is supposed to be. My feeling about impressionism, is you are able to recognize the subject...it just has a lot of texture and brush strokes.', '2007-09-09 15:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
