(4075145, 583246, 73250, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the crop...I would have cropped just below the elbow. There the viewer is drawn to the eye right away. I also think that were a light with your filter...you could have gone a little heavier to give it more texture.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the crop...I would have cropped just below the elbow. There the viewer is drawn to the eye right away. I also think that were a light with your filter...you could have gone a little heavier to give it more texture.', '2007-09-09 15:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075148, 582619, 73250, '<td valign="top">I''m not excited about the centering of the subject. You would have been right to follow the rule of thirds on this one. I do see the impressionistic feel...but, the bird needs a little more texture.</td>', 'I''m not excited about the centering of the subject. You would have been right to follow the rule of thirds on this one. I do see the impressionistic feel...but, the bird needs a little more texture.', '2007-09-09 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4075155, 583242, 73250, '<td valign="top">Your comp is decent...and I like the color on the ducks. But, the rest of the color is really muddied....far too much red/magenta. I also feel like I would crop of the top 1/4 of the image...the stuff at the top isn''t needed.</td>', 'Your comp is decent...and I like the color on the ducks. But, the rest of the color is really muddied....far too much red/magenta. I also feel like I would crop of the top 1/4 of the image...the stuff at the top isn''t needed.', '2007-09-09 15:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
