(4081115, 582956, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love the way you made the petals appear to be brush strokes.  I hope this does well, as it is outstanding and original.</td>', 'Love the way you made the petals appear to be brush strokes.  I hope this does well, as it is outstanding and original.', '2007-09-11 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
