(4082423, 580004, 74979, '<td valign="top">pretty reflections but color seems over saturated here without a lot of textures</td>', 'pretty reflections but color seems over saturated here without a lot of textures', '2007-09-11 22:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082424, 582785, 80542, '<td valign="top">This has a really wild 3-D effect!!</td>', 'This has a really wild 3-D effect!!', '2007-09-11 22:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082428, 583314, 80542, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color - so rich and warm</td>', 'Wonderful color - so rich and warm', '2007-09-11 22:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082429, 583098, 80542, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and balance.</td>', 'Nice silhouette and balance.', '2007-09-11 22:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082432, 583120, 80542, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the tree limbs as your natural frame.</td>', 'Nice use of the tree limbs as your natural frame.', '2007-09-11 22:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082727, 581300, 65811, '<td valign="top">I have to say that this picture is absolutely fantastic!!  It looks as though Vermeer himself had painted this.</td>', 'I have to say that this picture is absolutely fantastic!!  It looks as though Vermeer himself had painted this.', '2007-09-12 00:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082846, 582190, 18367, '<td valign="top">This is a truly stunning image, reminiscent of a Monet masterpiece.  I would be proud to have an image of this quality adorn the walls of my home. I most certainly hope that the viewers will recognize this for the masterpiece it is and reward you accordingly.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'This is a truly stunning image, reminiscent of a Monet masterpiece.  I would be proud to have an image of this quality adorn the walls of my home. I most certainly hope that the viewers will recognize this for the masterpiece it is and reward you accordingly.  A 10 from me.', '2007-09-12 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082881, 583151, 18367, '<td valign="top">Although the colours are totally different, your image reminds me somewhat of "Saint-Georges Majeur au crépuscule" by Monet.  You have manage to replicate the works of a master in the field of Impressionism, and I do hope you will fare well in the challenge.</td>', 'Although the colours are totally different, your image reminds me somewhat of "Saint-Georges Majeur au crépuscule" by Monet.  You have manage to replicate the works of a master in the field of Impressionism, and I do hope you will fare well in the challenge.', '2007-09-12 00:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082912, 581023, 18367, '<td valign="top">This would remind one of the "Boat at GIverny" by Monet.  It would seem that the photo was taken in the harsh afternoon light, which is a pity as I believe it detracts from an otherwise very pleasant image.  Good luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This would remind one of the "Boat at GIverny" by Monet.  It would seem that the photo was taken in the harsh afternoon light, which is a pity as I believe it detracts from an otherwise very pleasant image.  Good luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-09-12 00:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082924, 583281, 18367, '<td valign="top">Actually, it reminds me more of the Scarlet Sunset by JMW Turner.  This is indeed a beautiful image, but it may be a tad subtle for the voters in this venue.  I do hope you do well.</td>', 'Actually, it reminds me more of the Scarlet Sunset by JMW Turner.  This is indeed a beautiful image, but it may be a tad subtle for the voters in this venue.  I do hope you do well.', '2007-09-12 00:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082947, 583217, 18367, '<td valign="top">I see you were inspired by Monet''s "Water Lily Pond" and you truly have enriched this venue with a truly wonderful image that exemplifies the essence of impressionism.  Very well done indeed.</td>', 'I see you were inspired by Monet''s "Water Lily Pond" and you truly have enriched this venue with a truly wonderful image that exemplifies the essence of impressionism.  Very well done indeed.', '2007-09-12 01:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4082978, 581735, 18367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image which reminds me of a painting by Antoine Gaber, a Canadian artist.  Very nice, and I do hope you do well.</td>', 'Beautiful image which reminds me of a painting by Antoine Gaber, a Canadian artist.  Very nice, and I do hope you do well.', '2007-09-12 01:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4083066, 582704, 18367, '<td valign="top">Femme nue après le bain by Dégas must have been your inspiration for this truly wonderful work of art.  Very well done indeed.  Kudos on doing a remarkable job on this.</td>', 'Femme nue après le bain by Dégas must have been your inspiration for this truly wonderful work of art.  Very well done indeed.  Kudos on doing a remarkable job on this.', '2007-09-12 01:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
