(4084326, 582453, 68256, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful composition!  I love the fact that there is some detail in the 3rds with the pink flower that captures your attention.  The colors are wonderful.  Great job.  9</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful composition!  I love the fact that there is some detail in the 3rds with the pink flower that captures your attention.  The colors are wonderful.  Great job.  9', '2007-09-12 12:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084339, 581851, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  I''m a fan of muted colors, but I actually think I would have preferd more saturation and contrast on this one. (I can''t believe I just said that).  Also, I think the crop is too tight..the baloon needs more space.  Overall lovely capture though - 7</td>', 'Very well done!  I''m a fan of muted colors, but I actually think I would have preferd more saturation and contrast on this one. (I can''t believe I just said that).  Also, I think the crop is too tight..the baloon needs more space.  Overall lovely capture though - 7', '2007-09-12 12:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084367, 582245, 68256, '<td valign="top">Awesome burst of color!  I love the composition and "treatment".  The purple seems a little out of place with the yellow, red and green but it is still pretty pleasing to me.  7</td>', 'Awesome burst of color!  I love the composition and "treatment".  The purple seems a little out of place with the yellow, red and green but it is still pretty pleasing to me.  7', '2007-09-12 12:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
