(4084383, 583218, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the brilliant colors and super sharp subject.  I do wish the duck was swimming towards the camera, but what can you do?  The subject does seem to be completely overpowerd by the crazy water though.  7</td>', 'I love the brilliant colors and super sharp subject.  I do wish the duck was swimming towards the camera, but what can you do?  The subject does seem to be completely overpowerd by the crazy water though.  7', '2007-09-12 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
