(4084404, 582956, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow, that took a lot of work!  This would be such an awesome photo if the purple background leaves didn''t overpower the photo so much.  Perhaps if the wall in the back was white and you used the white petals for the background and/or got a little more seperation....I actually hate that I''m not giving this a 10 for effort, but I just can''t...</td>', 'Wow, that took a lot of work!  This would be such an awesome photo if the purple background leaves didn''t overpower the photo so much.  Perhaps if the wall in the back was white and you used the white petals for the background and/or got a little more seperation....I actually hate that I''m not giving this a 10 for effort, but I just can''t...', '2007-09-12 12:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084421, 582531, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition!  I love the lighting - very impressionistic.  I love the processing too.  10</td>', 'Beautiful composition!  I love the lighting - very impressionistic.  I love the processing too.  10', '2007-09-12 12:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4084428, 582064, 68256, '<td valign="top">Awesome work!  The only thing I can suggest that might have made it a little more interesting is some darkening of the bottom edge of the "bank".  It would have added some needed contrast and provided stability.  Great job though. - 8</td>', 'Awesome work!  The only thing I can suggest that might have made it a little more interesting is some darkening of the bottom edge of the "bank".  It would have added some needed contrast and provided stability.  Great job though. - 8', '2007-09-12 12:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
