(4087307, 581300, 68256, '<td valign="top">I voted a while back and didn''t leave a comment so I''m doing that now....I gave this an 8 and I really like the composition and "fitness" of challenge.  The tones and lighting are just fantastic.  The strange background really works well to support the subjects.  I am a very "simple" composition person so that is why I took off a little as there seems to be to many "exta" object thrown in.  Other than that small personal taste thing it is a wonderful photo.</td>', 'I voted a while back and didn''t leave a comment so I''m doing that now....I gave this an 8 and I really like the composition and "fitness" of challenge.  The tones and lighting are just fantastic.  The strange background really works well to support the subjects.  I am a very "simple" composition person so that is why I took off a little as there seems to be to many "exta" object thrown in.  Other than that small personal taste thing it is a wonderful photo.', '2007-09-13 12:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087313, 582251, 68256, '<td valign="top">Amazing composition!  The perspective works so well here and the "cleaness" of everything.  If you were painting a scene in the impressionistic tradition this is what you would paint....<br/> <br/>PS. I voted a couple of days ago so if your score doesn''t change that is the reason.</td>', 'Amazing composition!  The perspective works so well here and the "cleaness" of everything.  If you were painting a scene in the impressionistic tradition this is what you would paint.... PS. I voted a couple of days ago so if your score doesn''t change that is the reason.', '2007-09-13 12:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087315, 583272, 68256, '<td valign="top">Outstanding use of pattern and color!  This really looks wonderful.  The angle really works well too.  Great job.</td>', 'Outstanding use of pattern and color!  This really looks wonderful.  The angle really works well too.  Great job.', '2007-09-13 12:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087320, 583232, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love this simple composition and the looks so natural.  The muted tones are so wonderful and the gentle cloud reflections.  As far as constructive help, I would love to see it with the top portion cropped off ( the tree with the thin leaves cut out) and a little more space given to the bottom of the frame.  That would move the horizon up and give more space for the boat.  Otherwise this is perfect.  (ps I voted several days ago and am just now commenting)</td>', 'I love this simple composition and the looks so natural.  The muted tones are so wonderful and the gentle cloud reflections.  As far as constructive help, I would love to see it with the top portion cropped off ( the tree with the thin leaves cut out) and a little more space given to the bottom of the frame.  That would move the horizon up and give more space for the boat.  Otherwise this is perfect.  (ps I voted several days ago and am just now commenting)', '2007-09-13 12:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087324, 583097, 68256, '<td valign="top">Simple and elogant..I really like it.  Voted earlier in the week (8), but wanted to give you a comment. <br/> <br/>I think the oof petals in the front are a little "out of balance) because the overall treatment is soft anyway...So you end up with soft petals and REALLY soft petals...</td>', 'Simple and elogant..I really like it.  Voted earlier in the week (8), but wanted to give you a comment.  I think the oof petals in the front are a little "out of balance) because the overall treatment is soft anyway...So you end up with soft petals and REALLY soft petals...', '2007-09-13 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087329, 583251, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and lighting for this challenge.  All the space works well because the Heron is looking back into it.  I voted earlier in the week (7) but wanted to leave some comments.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and lighting for this challenge.  All the space works well because the Heron is looking back into it.  I voted earlier in the week (7) but wanted to leave some comments.', '2007-09-13 12:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087337, 583063, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism approach here and the impressionistic feel is great.  I''d prefered the object on the horizon be cloned out (I don''t know if that would be legal in advance though), to keep it even more simple.  I voted earlier in the week and just wanted to leave a comment.  7</td>', 'I like the minimalism approach here and the impressionistic feel is great.  I''d prefered the object on the horizon be cloned out (I don''t know if that would be legal in advance though), to keep it even more simple.  I voted earlier in the week and just wanted to leave a comment.  7', '2007-09-13 12:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087343, 582395, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very chaotic in composition and soothing in tone...makes for a strange composition but I like it.  Overall balance is great and it just "feels" right....I voted previously (7) and am just adding comments.</td>', 'Very chaotic in composition and soothing in tone...makes for a strange composition but I like it.  Overall balance is great and it just "feels" right....I voted previously (7) and am just adding comments.', '2007-09-13 12:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087346, 583075, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very well done in meeting the challenge, as it really looks like impressionism to me.  All technicals seem fine and the subject is well placed and posed.  I''m not sure why it doesn''t have more impact on my though.  7<br/> <br/>Edit to add, looking at the thumbnail and going back to review I think it is the overall contrast that keeps the photo from impacting me more.  Not changing my vote though because I do like it.</td>', 'Very well done in meeting the challenge, as it really looks like impressionism to me.  All technicals seem fine and the subject is well placed and posed.  I''m not sure why it doesn''t have more impact on my though.  7 Edit to add, looking at the thumbnail and going back to review I think it is the overall contrast that keeps the photo from impacting me more.  Not changing my vote though because I do like it.', '2007-09-13 12:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087349, 581023, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the great contrast here.  Composition is also wonderful.  Gave you a 7 earlier in the week and I think I''ll stick with that.  Very nice work.</td>', 'I love the great contrast here.  Composition is also wonderful.  Gave you a 7 earlier in the week and I think I''ll stick with that.  Very nice work.', '2007-09-13 12:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087351, 583207, 68256, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of light play and the composition is wonderful.  The sun is just a little to harsh for me (or perhaps it is that there is an SUV that the eyes are directed to).  I love the tones.  Very interesting overall and good demonstration of modern impressionistic work.  7<br/> <br/>Going back through the photos for a final look I''m bumping this up to 8..I really do like it.</td>', 'Awesome use of light play and the composition is wonderful.  The sun is just a little to harsh for me (or perhaps it is that there is an SUV that the eyes are directed to).  I love the tones.  Very interesting overall and good demonstration of modern impressionistic work.  7 Going back through the photos for a final look I''m bumping this up to 8..I really do like it.', '2007-09-13 12:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087355, 580961, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and execution of this.  Very well done.  Voted earlier in the week and just wanted to drop some comments.  7</td>', 'I love the idea and execution of this.  Very well done.  Voted earlier in the week and just wanted to drop some comments.  7', '2007-09-13 12:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4087358, 581496, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful composition!  I love those paths that the birds have created.  The lighting and composition are dead on for Impressionism (at least in my mind).  Voted earlier in the week a 7 but bumping to 8 now.  I just love the lighting....</td>', 'Very beautiful composition!  I love those paths that the birds have created.  The lighting and composition are dead on for Impressionism (at least in my mind).  Voted earlier in the week a 7 but bumping to 8 now.  I just love the lighting....', '2007-09-13 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
