(4087366, 581609, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition!  I wonder if it would be legal to clean up some of the brush strokes around the petals so they didn''t blend with the background?  I think that would have provided some much needed separation to the flower.</td>', 'Beautiful composition!  I wonder if it would be legal to clean up some of the brush strokes around the petals so they didn''t blend with the background?  I think that would have provided some much needed separation to the flower.', '2007-09-13 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
