(4088314, 582701, 56849, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this shot realy fits into the challenge theme so I''m only giving it a 9. It''s a great image!</td>', 'I don''t think this shot realy fits into the challenge theme so I''m only giving it a 9. It''s a great image!', '2007-09-13 21:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088330, 582682, 83631, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  Love it.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  Love it.', '2007-09-13 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088331, 582704, 83631, '<td valign="top">Spot on - play of light on dark, broken brush strokes, - how did you do it?</td>', 'Spot on - play of light on dark, broken brush strokes, - how did you do it?', '2007-09-13 21:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088347, 581300, 83631, '<td valign="top">Very authentic.  I like the wrinkled skin of the peaches - adds interest.</td>', 'Very authentic.  I like the wrinkled skin of the peaches - adds interest.', '2007-09-13 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088391, 582956, 55005, '<td valign="top">Wow.  All the petals!  This is beautiful -- one of my favorites in this challenge!  I really hope to see it ribbon!</td>', 'Wow.  All the petals!  This is beautiful -- one of my favorites in this challenge!  I really hope to see it ribbon!', '2007-09-13 22:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088392, 582196, 55005, '<td valign="top">The light here is just so perfect!  Beautiful!</td>', 'The light here is just so perfect!  Beautiful!', '2007-09-13 22:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088393, 583205, 49773, '<td valign="top">This is great!</td>', 'This is great!', '2007-09-13 22:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088424, 582957, 49773, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect you got there, I like how the umbrella pops out! Great work.</td>', 'Interesting effect you got there, I like how the umbrella pops out! Great work.', '2007-09-13 22:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088428, 583210, 49773, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most interesting shots in this bunch. I like the polaroid colors and smooth textures. Really charming.</td>', 'This is one of the most interesting shots in this bunch. I like the polaroid colors and smooth textures. Really charming.', '2007-09-13 22:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088430, 582427, 49773, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the isolated and framed leaves, it''s interesting how they flock together.</td>', 'I like the composition and the isolated and framed leaves, it''s interesting how they flock together.', '2007-09-13 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088431, 582604, 83631, '<td valign="top">Very nice - good interpretation of challenge.  I love how each tree stands out.</td>', 'Very nice - good interpretation of challenge.  I love how each tree stands out.', '2007-09-13 22:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088437, 583005, 83631, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile.  Very nice.</td>', 'This makes me smile.  Very nice.', '2007-09-13 22:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088444, 583086, 83631, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Reminiscent of Sunlight, Frank Weston Benson.</td>', 'Lovely.  Reminiscent of Sunlight, Frank Weston Benson.', '2007-09-13 22:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088454, 582704, 49773, '<td valign="top">Ok, you won.</td>', 'Ok, you won.', '2007-09-13 22:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088455, 580803, 83631, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2007-09-13 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088508, 582710, 50695, '<td valign="top">two impressions fell in love and became one. This is an OOBIE masterpiece.</td>', 'two impressions fell in love and became one. This is an OOBIE masterpiece.', '2007-09-13 23:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088509, 580417, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating, creepy abstract. I wonder if it''s a tribute to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=32997" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bucket</a>''s Parade? It sure seems that way to my twisted mind.</td>', 'fascinating, creepy abstract. I wonder if it''s a tribute to  bucket''s Parade? It sure seems that way to my twisted mind.', '2007-09-13 23:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088511, 580684, 50695, '<td valign="top">Amazing how in the foreground I can see it''s a photograph, but then it slips into a painting. You are one of the rare Van Gogh''s in this challenge.</td>', 'Amazing how in the foreground I can see it''s a photograph, but then it slips into a painting. You are one of the rare Van Gogh''s in this challenge.', '2007-09-13 23:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088512, 580922, 50695, '<td valign="top">stunning portrait. It reminds of a Monet painting where a woman''s face is obscure by a brush stroke, as if the wind is erasing her. In this case, the water, is erasing her.</td>', 'stunning portrait. It reminds of a Monet painting where a woman''s face is obscure by a brush stroke, as if the wind is erasing her. In this case, the water, is erasing her.', '2007-09-13 23:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088513, 583111, 50695, '<td valign="top">you''re probably getting killed for the darkness, but this attitude toward people, this impatience toward them, is pure Impressionism, and paved the way for the Abstract revolution to come.<br/> <br/>"Don''t look at the people, bourgeois fools! Look at the light on the water!"</td>', 'you''re probably getting killed for the darkness, but this attitude toward people, this impatience toward them, is pure Impressionism, and paved the way for the Abstract revolution to come. "Don''t look at the people, bourgeois fools! Look at the light on the water!"', '2007-09-13 23:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088514, 583257, 50695, '<td valign="top">spiritual impressionism. worship light and color. I bet this is getting a reaction similar to the one the Impressionists got in their day.</td>', 'spiritual impressionism. worship light and color. I bet this is getting a reaction similar to the one the Impressionists got in their day.', '2007-09-13 23:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088515, 583207, 50695, '<td valign="top">the study of light on fences. This is a beautiful, beautiful photograph of nothing, which is very much akin to Impressionism.</td>', 'the study of light on fences. This is a beautiful, beautiful photograph of nothing, which is very much akin to Impressionism.', '2007-09-13 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088516, 582619, 50695, '<td valign="top">this looks like you did it in camera, in which case you are a miracle worker. Stunning.</td>', 'this looks like you did it in camera, in which case you are a miracle worker. Stunning.', '2007-09-13 23:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088518, 583210, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 10 in hopes that it''s not a painting filter in Photoshop. I can dream, can''t I? Even if it is, I can tell the original is lending itself to it.</td>', 'I''m giving this a 10 in hopes that it''s not a painting filter in Photoshop. I can dream, can''t I? Even if it is, I can tell the original is lending itself to it.', '2007-09-13 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088521, 582957, 50695, '<td valign="top">stunning effect. The curve motif is painterly and photographic at the same time. then there is the unexpected sharpness of the umbrella. The photo dances between two dimensions and three.</td>', 'stunning effect. The curve motif is painterly and photographic at the same time. then there is the unexpected sharpness of the umbrella. The photo dances between two dimensions and three.', '2007-09-13 23:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088526, 583330, 50695, '<td valign="top">Here I am looking for Impressionism and you stun me with a great photograph. This photo demands to be seen on its own terms, which I can easily turn towards the challenge. After all the, moth is infused with light, and it seems as though the same light is portrayed in the background. With light being such an important character in this story, how can it not be Impressionism?<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'Here I am looking for Impressionism and you stun me with a great photograph. This photo demands to be seen on its own terms, which I can easily turn towards the challenge. After all the, moth is infused with light, and it seems as though the same light is portrayed in the background. With light being such an important character in this story, how can it not be Impressionism? Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-09-13 23:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088538, 580528, 50695, '<td valign="top">I **love** this interpretation of the challenge. You use the "interference" of water as the equivalent of the Impressionist painting techniques to make light your subject.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I **love** this interpretation of the challenge. You use the "interference" of water as the equivalent of the Impressionist painting techniques to make light your subject. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2007-09-13 23:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4088540, 583094, 50695, '<td valign="top">This reminds me so much of a Manet portrait. It is a sensuous, living image.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This reminds me so much of a Manet portrait. It is a sensuous, living image. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon ', '2007-09-13 23:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
