(4088928, 582196, 47483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i> One of my favorites in the challenge.  </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, this is one of my fav photos. I am probably going to print it and going to hang in my house. <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by yanko:</b></div><hr/><i>  The light and texture both have purpose. One to see and the other to touch. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is also true, this was very thoughtful composition. It follows almost everything of a good composition. Keeping things simple, accentuate the subject matter. And say what we wish to say easily. The viewer does not have to put his/her mind and can enjoy the beauty and the message behind.</td>', 'Originally posted by yanko: One of my favorites in the challenge.    Yes, this is one of my fav photos. I am probably going to print it and going to hang in my house.  Originally posted by yanko:  The light and texture both have purpose. One to see and the other to touch.   This is also true, this was very thoughtful composition. It follows almost everything of a good composition. Keeping things simple, accentuate the subject matter. And say what we wish to say easily. The viewer does not have to put his/her mind and can enjoy the beauty and the message behind.', '2007-09-14 03:29:35.000000', NULL, 0),
