(4089199, 583086, 11920, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon', '2007-09-14 08:49:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089201, 582084, 57229, '<td valign="top">Do I see a teeny difference between the commenters'' evaluation and the ''all users'' one? You got more than me, anyway :)<br/>It''s a brilliant picture - nailed by the title - and that conveyance of mood and feeling has to be a big bit of what impressionism''s about. Surprised it didn''t score higher? W-e-e-e-ll ... the fact that just about anything with a couple of Pshop filters to make it look like a painting would have scored higher will just have to speak for itself, to whomsoever may be listening.</td>', 'Do I see a teeny difference between the commenters'' evaluation and the ''all users'' one? You got more than me, anyway :)It''s a brilliant picture - nailed by the title - and that conveyance of mood and feeling has to be a big bit of what impressionism''s about. Surprised it didn''t score higher? W-e-e-e-ll ... the fact that just about anything with a couple of Pshop filters to make it look like a painting would have scored higher will just have to speak for itself, to whomsoever may be listening.', '2007-09-14 08:52:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089217, 582084, 53147, '<td valign="top">I didnt even get a chance to look at images from this challenge until today, and I noticed this one in your profile page. Grabbed me from thumb because of the color and shadows. I can see that this image would not score well with the masses, but would strongly touch a handful. I would have scored it a 7 had i voted on it. Has a depressing feel to it yet I cant seem to look away. Made all the more powerful knowing that this could be the living quarters of a friend of mine. Not pretty eyecandy but surely an image with power.  4.8 - blah!</td>', 'I didnt even get a chance to look at images from this challenge until today, and I noticed this one in your profile page. Grabbed me from thumb because of the color and shadows. I can see that this image would not score well with the masses, but would strongly touch a handful. I would have scored it a 7 had i voted on it. Has a depressing feel to it yet I cant seem to look away. Made all the more powerful knowing that this could be the living quarters of a friend of mine. Not pretty eyecandy but surely an image with power.  4.8 - blah!', '2007-09-14 09:06:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089230, 582957, 52169, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad you did not use a filter-I did''nt think you did. Beautiful and a favorite.</td>', 'I''m so glad you did not use a filter-I did''nt think you did. Beautiful and a favorite.', '2007-09-14 09:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089238, 582956, 37730, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2007-09-14 09:22:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089239, 581300, 43463, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on composition of this still life for the lighting and elements really carry it off as an oil painting. Your friend''s eye really helped you nail it in this photo. Love the lighting, the colors, shapes and textures one sees in this still life photo study.</td>', 'Excellent job on composition of this still life for the lighting and elements really carry it off as an oil painting. Your friend''s eye really helped you nail it in this photo. Love the lighting, the colors, shapes and textures one sees in this still life photo study.', '2007-09-14 09:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089247, 582956, 53572, '<td valign="top">this should have won indeed, because a) it''s a lovely shot, b) the huge effort that went into the set-up, and c) no ''art'' filters were used.  well done indeed.</td>', 'this should have won indeed, because a) it''s a lovely shot, b) the huge effort that went into the set-up, and c) no ''art'' filters were used.  well done indeed.', '2007-09-14 09:27:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089253, 580860, 34462, '<td valign="top">It looks impressionistic! Good job Michelle.</td>', 'It looks impressionistic! Good job Michelle.', '2007-09-14 09:30:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089258, 583210, 61961, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize you had done this without photoshop filters.  I would have scored it higher had I known.  You are right, it does look like an 80''s abstract!   I don''t think "modern impressionism" is a real movement.</td>', 'I didn''t realize you had done this without photoshop filters.  I would have scored it higher had I known.  You are right, it does look like an 80''s abstract!   I don''t think "modern impressionism" is a real movement.', '2007-09-14 09:35:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089259, 583333, 43463, '<td valign="top">I sat this one out but went browsing (no voting) through the galleries during voting and missed seeing this beauty. While I don''t get the strong impresssion of  ''brush strokes'' I think you nailed the painting impressionism style of compositional shapes, bright colors, and play of light on main elements. Love that soft focus or glow that causes these flowers to really reach out and grab the viewer''s attention - and it was accomplished by simple hairspray on the camera filter! (I am going to have to try that sometime). This is a lovely piece.</td>', 'I sat this one out but went browsing (no voting) through the galleries during voting and missed seeing this beauty. While I don''t get the strong impresssion of  ''brush strokes'' I think you nailed the painting impressionism style of compositional shapes, bright colors, and play of light on main elements. Love that soft focus or glow that causes these flowers to really reach out and grab the viewer''s attention - and it was accomplished by simple hairspray on the camera filter! (I am going to have to try that sometime). This is a lovely piece.', '2007-09-14 09:35:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089269, 582956, 52169, '<td valign="top">Congrats! I loved this one.</td>', 'Congrats! I loved this one.', '2007-09-14 09:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089270, 582704, 52169, '<td valign="top">Congrats. I love the orginal too!</td>', 'Congrats. I love the orginal too!', '2007-09-14 09:40:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089273, 582084, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb - I had no idea this was yours and gave you a high vote as well! I find it most interesting. Seems the very epitome of bleak. Well done. Just hit the ignore button on that score :-)</td>', 'Deb - I had no idea this was yours and gave you a high vote as well! I find it most interesting. Seems the very epitome of bleak. Well done. Just hit the ignore button on that score :-)', '2007-09-14 09:41:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089279, 582956, 38032, '<td valign="top">brilliant! - awesome idea - the thumbnail-to-full-size surprise is great!</td>', 'brilliant! - awesome idea - the thumbnail-to-full-size surprise is great!', '2007-09-14 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089281, 582704, 44825, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon. A masterpiece!</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon. A masterpiece!', '2007-09-14 09:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089295, 582092, 47483, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, colors in this are joyful. Very much pleasing.</td>', 'This is beautiful, colors in this are joyful. Very much pleasing.', '2007-09-14 09:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089303, 582921, 66597, '<td valign="top">Hey Terry, you really got robbed on this. I was one of your 8''s. Fine work indeed, really looks like a Monet. I''m especially impressed that you didn''t use any special filters on this.</td>', 'Hey Terry, you really got robbed on this. I was one of your 8''s. Fine work indeed, really looks like a Monet. I''m especially impressed that you didn''t use any special filters on this.', '2007-09-14 09:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089307, 582956, 9821, '<td valign="top">brilliant</td>', 'brilliant', '2007-09-14 09:52:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089332, 583086, 43463, '<td valign="top">I sat this one out but went browsing (no voting) through the galleries during voting and saw your entry, fell in love with it, and fav''ed it. I am coming back now that I have some time to breath to tell you what I loved. You captured the ''feel'' and compositional elements that I have seen in so many of the impressionism paintings that I teach to the children. I absolutely love that you chose an ''everyday activity'' of times gone and had your daughter dress in old style clothes to add to a feel of  a time in the 1800''s or early 19th century. While the brush strokes were added later it REALLY adds to the impressionistic painting style BUT what really hits the ball out of the park is that you paid attention to the compositional elements, lighting, the play of light on the composition''s elements and theme. For me, your photo painting really captured the moment and brought to mind that of Pierre-Auguste Renoir''s <a href="//www.ibiblio.org/wm/paint/auth/renoir/renoir.meadow.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">In the Meadow</a>, <a href="//www.ibiblio.org/wm/paint/auth/renoir/laundress.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Laundress</a>, and <a href="//www.metmuseum.org/store/st_family_viewer.asp/familyID/%7B860F07EB-3D58-4812-B8BF-763E8326B79B%7D/FromPage/catMusic/callFromRelViewer/y/callFromFamViewer/y/SpecialPermFlag//catID/%7B64E7905E-12C6-4B4F-A23A-1D66F23153C6%7D/FromSearch/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Luncheon of the Boating Party</a> Beautifullly done and captured. Congradulations on the blue!!!!</td>', 'I sat this one out but went browsing (no voting) through the galleries during voting and saw your entry, fell in love with it, and fav''ed it. I am coming back now that I have some time to breath to tell you what I loved. You captured the ''feel'' and compositional elements that I have seen in so many of the impressionism paintings that I teach to the children. I absolutely love that you chose an ''everyday activity'' of times gone and had your daughter dress in old style clothes to add to a feel of  a time in the 1800''s or early 19th century. While the brush strokes were added later it REALLY adds to the impressionistic painting style BUT what really hits the ball out of the park is that you paid attention to the compositional elements, lighting, the play of light on the composition''s elements and theme. For me, your photo painting really captured the moment and brought to mind that of Pierre-Auguste Renoir''s In the Meadow, The Laundress, and Luncheon of the Boating Party Beautifullly done and captured. Congradulations on the blue!!!!', '2007-09-14 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089333, 583086, 63750, '<td valign="top">Really spectacular. I liked mine in this contest, but I''m really in awe of this shot.</td>', 'Really spectacular. I liked mine in this contest, but I''m really in awe of this shot.', '2007-09-14 10:07:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089334, 583086, 42100, '<td valign="top">The dynamic composition really completes this...congratulations on winning the blue ribbon Jason!</td>', 'The dynamic composition really completes this...congratulations on winning the blue ribbon Jason!', '2007-09-14 10:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
