(4089391, 582704, 24454, '<td valign="top">And this is another one that I knew as soon as I saw it would likely ribbon!   And I love it so much when the voters vote just how I think they should :)<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS!   This is just beautiful!<br/> <br/></td>', 'And this is another one that I knew as soon as I saw it would likely ribbon!   And I love it so much when the voters vote just how I think they should :) CONGRATULATIONS!   This is just beautiful! ', '2007-09-14 10:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
