(4089607, 581300, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon.  It''s a gorgeous work.  I would have scored it higher (I gave it a 7) if the subject had been "oil painting", but as others have indicated, to me it''s not really impressionism nor even post-impressionism.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon.  It''s a gorgeous work.  I would have scored it higher (I gave it a 7) if the subject had been "oil painting", but as others have indicated, to me it''s not really impressionism nor even post-impressionism.', '2007-09-14 12:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089609, 581226, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hi Charlene!  I did not vote in this challenge as I still don''t really have a good idea of what truly is a photographic impressionistic interpretation.  In this, I do like the zoom blur on the right and then the contrast of oranges, yellows, and greens.  The colors here really do catch your attention.  A very pretty photo!</td>', 'Hi Charlene!  I did not vote in this challenge as I still don''t really have a good idea of what truly is a photographic impressionistic interpretation.  In this, I do like the zoom blur on the right and then the contrast of oranges, yellows, and greens.  The colors here really do catch your attention.  A very pretty photo!', '2007-09-14 12:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089629, 583200, 11920, '<td valign="top">Don <br/>Nice photo,I would have liked to see this on the darker side.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-14 11:03:49.</i></td>', 'Don Nice photo,I would have liked to see this on the darker side.', '2007-09-14 12:03:29.000000', '2007-09-14 12:03:49.000000', 0),
(4089635, 581845, 811, '<td valign="top">FWIW, in my humble, uneducated, consistently low scoring opinion, *this* shot met the challenge of "impressionism" better than some at the opposite end of the spectrum.  Go figure. :)</td>', 'FWIW, in my humble, uneducated, consistently low scoring opinion, *this* shot met the challenge of "impressionism" better than some at the opposite end of the spectrum.  Go figure. :)', '2007-09-14 12:04:01.000000', NULL, 0),
