(4089830, 580586, 74605, '<td valign="top">Beautiful simplicity.  I like this a lot!  Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful simplicity.  I like this a lot!  Well done.', '2007-09-14 12:37:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089840, 581300, 35322, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful picture, but it doesn''t look very "impressionist". You should have used a filter or smth else in order to enhance some strokes. One of the trademarks of impressionism is the visible brushstrokes, which do not appear in your picture.<br/>I am sorry to be the one that hammers down this picture, because it''s a very beautiful one, but to me this does not reflect impressionism. Just my opinion, of course.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Bianca</td>', 'This is a very beautiful picture, but it doesn''t look very "impressionist". You should have used a filter or smth else in order to enhance some strokes. One of the trademarks of impressionism is the visible brushstrokes, which do not appear in your picture.I am sorry to be the one that hammers down this picture, because it''s a very beautiful one, but to me this does not reflect impressionism. Just my opinion, of course. Cheers,Bianca', '2007-09-14 12:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089850, 582092, 12253, '<td valign="top">Karen, thanks for your kind words and posthumous nomination for my image.  I just stopped by to see which is yours, and wanted to mention that I thought this was fantastic, and an excellent interpretation of photoimpressionism.  It was one of three 10''s I gave in the challenge.  Congratulations on you 13th place shot here!  Shame voters down-voted the lot, so the averages are so low.</td>', 'Karen, thanks for your kind words and posthumous nomination for my image.  I just stopped by to see which is yours, and wanted to mention that I thought this was fantastic, and an excellent interpretation of photoimpressionism.  It was one of three 10''s I gave in the challenge.  Congratulations on you 13th place shot here!  Shame voters down-voted the lot, so the averages are so low.', '2007-09-14 12:46:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089853, 580860, 30861, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2007-09-14 12:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089862, 582821, 53572, '<td valign="top">well done, jeffrey.  this is super, and it makes it extra good that no ps filters were used.</td>', 'well done, jeffrey.  this is super, and it makes it extra good that no ps filters were used.', '2007-09-14 12:56:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089863, 581300, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by anotherday:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a very beautiful picture, but it doesn''t look very "impressionist". You should have used a filter or smth else in order to enhance some strokes. One of the trademarks of impressionism is the visible brushstrokes, which do not appear in your picture.<br/>I am sorry to be the one that hammers down this picture, because it''s a very beautiful one, but to me this does not reflect impressionism. Just my opinion, of course.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Bianca </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you, your opinion is very valid. I do not see Impressionism in photography the same way as I look upon Impressionism within art, I do not feel that by adding a filter that creates brush strokes would then label this photograph as Impressionism. however I do feel that impressionism is opinionated and each to their own.<br/> <br/>Thank you very much for your honesty</td>', 'Originally posted by anotherday: This is a very beautiful picture, but it doesn''t look very "impressionist". You should have used a filter or smth else in order to enhance some strokes. One of the trademarks of impressionism is the visible brushstrokes, which do not appear in your picture.I am sorry to be the one that hammers down this picture, because it''s a very beautiful one, but to me this does not reflect impressionism. Just my opinion, of course. Cheers,Bianca   Thank you, your opinion is very valid. I do not see Impressionism in photography the same way as I look upon Impressionism within art, I do not feel that by adding a filter that creates brush strokes would then label this photograph as Impressionism. however I do feel that impressionism is opinionated and each to their own. Thank you very much for your honesty', '2007-09-14 12:56:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089870, 583006, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lisa, this is such a pretty and simple picture.  I love the softness of the leaves.  It looks like a wonderful place to take a walk.</td>', 'Lisa, this is such a pretty and simple picture.  I love the softness of the leaves.  It looks like a wonderful place to take a walk.', '2007-09-14 13:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
