(4089895, 583282, 326, '<td valign="top">Dang Libby I''m impressed!!!! This should have placed higher!! I gave this a 10.</td>', 'Dang Libby I''m impressed!!!! This should have placed higher!! I gave this a 10.', '2007-09-14 13:11:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089915, 581300, 326, '<td valign="top">THIS IS A PIECE OF ART! I GAVE IT A 10!</td>', 'THIS IS A PIECE OF ART! I GAVE IT A 10!', '2007-09-14 13:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089930, 582956, 66952, '<td valign="top">Excellent as usual, Steve. What a great way to get the impressionistic effect. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Excellent as usual, Steve. What a great way to get the impressionistic effect. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2007-09-14 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089934, 582704, 66952, '<td valign="top">You have nothing to apologize about with the filters. The effect is excellent, and you met the challenge perfectly. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'You have nothing to apologize about with the filters. The effect is excellent, and you met the challenge perfectly. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2007-09-14 13:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089936, 582821, 66384, '<td valign="top">Hey, Jeffery, I tried exactly the same thing -- vaseline on a UV filter shooting sunbathers at the beach. I had exactly the same experience -- couldn''t see a thing except the vaseline. I kept wiping and shooting. BUT I never did get a good shot from it. There lies the big difference in our photography. You got a marvelous shot. Congratulations.</td>', 'Hey, Jeffery, I tried exactly the same thing -- vaseline on a UV filter shooting sunbathers at the beach. I had exactly the same experience -- couldn''t see a thing except the vaseline. I kept wiping and shooting. BUT I never did get a good shot from it. There lies the big difference in our photography. You got a marvelous shot. Congratulations.', '2007-09-14 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089941, 581434, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love your composition and the soft colors.</td>', 'I love your composition and the soft colors.', '2007-09-14 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089947, 582921, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, Terry. I love the light and the composition of the lily pads. The background is a perfect complement, and does a good job of imitating impressionistic painting.</td>', 'This is beautiful, Terry. I love the light and the composition of the lily pads. The background is a perfect complement, and does a good job of imitating impressionistic painting.', '2007-09-14 13:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089948, 581845, 66952, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why this scored so low, I really like it (I didn''t vote). But after looking at it for a couple of minutes, I''m having trouble getting my eyes to focus on other things. ;-)</td>', 'I have no idea why this scored so low, I really like it (I didn''t vote). But after looking at it for a couple of minutes, I''m having trouble getting my eyes to focus on other things. ;-)', '2007-09-14 13:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089949, 581300, 32872, '<td valign="top">I gave your beautiful image a 10 as well!!  This is one of the most gorgeous images I''ve ever seen.  I agree your photo is truly a work of art.  Congratulations!!</td>', 'I gave your beautiful image a 10 as well!!  This is one of the most gorgeous images I''ve ever seen.  I agree your photo is truly a work of art.  Congratulations!!', '2007-09-14 13:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089953, 583205, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I gave this a 4.  I think the basic subject just didn''t do it, but also the yellow thing on the left and the white blob on the bottom are distracting.<br/> <br/>But as far as "improving" as a photographer, I think you should put the score in context.  Your two commenters during the challenge averaged an 8, so you clearly connected very strongly with them.<br/> <br/>The score tells you that DPC voters, on average, didn''t like it much.  But you have to decide whether that matters to you.  If it does, explore what scored highly in this challenge and in other challenges, and work to emulate those shots.<br/> <br/>If not, continue doing whatever you like and use the scores to gauge the average DPC appreciation, but not ultimate value.</td>', 'Hi.  I gave this a 4.  I think the basic subject just didn''t do it, but also the yellow thing on the left and the white blob on the bottom are distracting. But as far as "improving" as a photographer, I think you should put the score in context.  Your two commenters during the challenge averaged an 8, so you clearly connected very strongly with them. The score tells you that DPC voters, on average, didn''t like it much.  But you have to decide whether that matters to you.  If it does, explore what scored highly in this challenge and in other challenges, and work to emulate those shots. If not, continue doing whatever you like and use the scores to gauge the average DPC appreciation, but not ultimate value.', '2007-09-14 13:33:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089963, 583333, 66952, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but this is utterly gorgeous. Perfect just the way it is.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but this is utterly gorgeous. Perfect just the way it is.', '2007-09-14 13:37:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4089966, 583204, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great subject and excellent PP. I''m going to have to get PP lessons from you. I love the mood of this shot. It makes me want to be there.<br/> <br/>Oh, I almost forgot, congratulations on you 5th place!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-14 12:41:46.</i></td>', 'Great subject and excellent PP. I''m going to have to get PP lessons from you. I love the mood of this shot. It makes me want to be there. Oh, I almost forgot, congratulations on you 5th place!!!', '2007-09-14 13:40:21.000000', '2007-09-14 13:41:46.000000', 0),
(4089974, 580541, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised at the score;  I voted this a 6.  I thought it was clear what we were looking at, and that you reduced the objects to an impression of them.</td>', 'I''m surprised at the score;  I voted this a 6.  I thought it was clear what we were looking at, and that you reduced the objects to an impression of them.', '2007-09-14 13:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
