(4090166, 582704, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon!  I''m one of the people who prefers entries without such heavy filters, but don''t think for a minute that means I think you somehow didn''t deserve it.  Everyone has their own opinions, but it''s the collective vote that determines the winners, and you scored highly.  Also, don''t forget the importance of subject choice, composition, lighting, etc.  So be proud! :)</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon!  I''m one of the people who prefers entries without such heavy filters, but don''t think for a minute that means I think you somehow didn''t deserve it.  Everyone has their own opinions, but it''s the collective vote that determines the winners, and you scored highly.  Also, don''t forget the importance of subject choice, composition, lighting, etc.  So be proud! :)', '2007-09-14 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 0),
