(4090174, 582704, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely fantastic, IMO.  If I saw this hanging in a museum surrounded by famous impressionist paintings, it would totally blend in.  Actually, it would probably stand out as being one of the more pleasant ones to look at!<br/>Really well done.  Must add to faves...</td>', 'This is absolutely fantastic, IMO.  If I saw this hanging in a museum surrounded by famous impressionist paintings, it would totally blend in.  Actually, it would probably stand out as being one of the more pleasant ones to look at!Really well done.  Must add to faves...', '2007-09-14 15:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
