(4092651, 582789, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like the pastel shades in this too. The "Impressionism" challenge was a fun learning experience for everyone. Not to say that the scores couldn''t have been better, but it seems that the perception of impressionism depends a lot on the individual and their experiences. I rather like seeing things not quite in focus sometimes, as in real life, we do not always have the time to see and focus on every scene that we see. Impressionism seems to cover that aspect of our life experiences well.</td>', 'I like the pastel shades in this too. The "Impressionism" challenge was a fun learning experience for everyone. Not to say that the scores couldn''t have been better, but it seems that the perception of impressionism depends a lot on the individual and their experiences. I rather like seeing things not quite in focus sometimes, as in real life, we do not always have the time to see and focus on every scene that we see. Impressionism seems to cover that aspect of our life experiences well.', '2007-09-15 23:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4092652, 579837, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful, cheerful shot!!! And look, there is not a 1, 2, or 3 vote in the whole lot. Fabulous. I love the filters -- just right. Congratulation on the 6 and on the good finish and on the PB. Oh, and you got a FAV!</td>', 'What a wonderful, cheerful shot!!! And look, there is not a 1, 2, or 3 vote in the whole lot. Fabulous. I love the filters -- just right. Congratulation on the 6 and on the good finish and on the PB. Oh, and you got a FAV!', '2007-09-15 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4092745, 580875, 62249, '<td valign="top">I love this, both before and after the Impressionism effects.</td>', 'I love this, both before and after the Impressionism effects.', '2007-09-16 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 0),
