(4093149, 582704, 22564, '<td valign="top">By the way, the name of the painter is Degas, Edgar Germain Hilaire is just his first name (long one, indeed :)). He is well known for his numerous paintings of classical dancers. And being French and not German, the name of the painting is "La toilette". ^^<br/> <br/>Anyway, congrats for your really nice work. You made an excellent work with the filters.</td>', 'By the way, the name of the painter is Degas, Edgar Germain Hilaire is just his first name (long one, indeed :)). He is well known for his numerous paintings of classical dancers. And being French and not German, the name of the painting is "La toilette". ^^ Anyway, congrats for your really nice work. You made an excellent work with the filters.', '2007-09-16 07:18:24.000000', NULL, 0),
