(4094955, 583340, 62637, '<td valign="top">dude, that is some NASTY looking noise...  this is out of a 40D??  there is some serious vertical pattern noise happenin there!  was this severely underexposed originally?</td>', 'dude, that is some NASTY looking noise...  this is out of a 40D??  there is some serious vertical pattern noise happenin there!  was this severely underexposed originally?', '2007-09-16 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4095061, 581735, 67697, '<td valign="top">You fooled people into thinking you used a filter - good for you!  I like the diagonal streaks and how it goes hand in hand with some of the parallel branches.</td>', 'You fooled people into thinking you used a filter - good for you!  I like the diagonal streaks and how it goes hand in hand with some of the parallel branches.', '2007-09-17 00:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4095091, 583340, 30454, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by option:</b></div><hr/><i> dude, that is some NASTY looking noise...  this is out of a 40D??  there is some serious vertical pattern noise happenin there!  was this severely underexposed originally? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yes, it was under exposed. I added some more noise trying to meet the challenge. I also moved the camera purposefully to add effects. I just submitted for the sake of it. Now feeling bad about first image for 40D on DPC.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-17 11:42:29.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by option: dude, that is some NASTY looking noise...  this is out of a 40D??  there is some serious vertical pattern noise happenin there!  was this severely underexposed originally?   yes, it was under exposed. I added some more noise trying to meet the challenge. I also moved the camera purposefully to add effects. I just submitted for the sake of it. Now feeling bad about first image for 40D on DPC.', '2007-09-17 00:56:37.000000', '2007-09-17 12:42:29.000000', 0),
(4095198, 583086, 39427, '<td valign="top">You did everything right here.  Fav''d &amp; congrats!</td>', 'You did everything right here.  Fav''d & congrats!', '2007-09-17 01:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4095217, 582937, 67697, '<td valign="top">Dave, this is very pretty.  Looks almost like a painting!  Love the reflection.</td>', 'Dave, this is very pretty.  Looks almost like a painting!  Love the reflection.', '2007-09-17 01:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4095443, 583340, 62637, '<td valign="top">haha, dont worry bout it, it was a tough challenge to "fit" into.<br/> <br/>maybe put a disclaimer in your photographers notes before the "40D has VPN problems!!!" rumours start to fly.  never heard the end of it when the K10D came out.</td>', 'haha, dont worry bout it, it was a tough challenge to "fit" into. maybe put a disclaimer in your photographers notes before the "40D has VPN problems!!!" rumours start to fly.  never heard the end of it when the K10D came out.', '2007-09-17 02:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096119, 582710, 67841, '<td valign="top">Wow - people <i>really</i> didn''t get this one, did they?  This is truly one of the great shots of this challenge &amp; its score is indicative of the intelligence of the average DPCer...</td>', 'Wow - people really didn''t get this one, did they?  This is truly one of the great shots of this challenge & its score is indicative of the intelligence of the average DPCer...', '2007-09-17 10:56:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096603, 583204, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, congrats on your 5th place!  Curious that it is both in-camera and processing effect - wonder what it looked like without the watercolor filter, that is, what effect did you get with just the gel-covered glass alone?</td>', 'Beautiful light, congrats on your 5th place!  Curious that it is both in-camera and processing effect - wonder what it looked like without the watercolor filter, that is, what effect did you get with just the gel-covered glass alone?', '2007-09-17 14:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096640, 581528, 61651, '<td valign="top">Your technique gives it, oddly, a photorealism painting technique look - I rather like this, but agree with you that it''s dubiously "impressionistic" (although I don''t think it''s a shoehorn).  However I had given it an 8, since I think it''s a nicely done image.  Bland isn''t always bad - this is nice study of light.</td>', 'Your technique gives it, oddly, a photorealism painting technique look - I rather like this, but agree with you that it''s dubiously "impressionistic" (although I don''t think it''s a shoehorn).  However I had given it an 8, since I think it''s a nicely done image.  Bland isn''t always bad - this is nice study of light.', '2007-09-17 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096657, 582821, 61651, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites for the challenge - excellent abstraction, lively colors.  Modernist impressionism, well done!</td>', 'One of my favorites for the challenge - excellent abstraction, lively colors.  Modernist impressionism, well done!', '2007-09-17 14:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096666, 582084, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think the feel of the place comes across very well - institutional and very bleak indeed.  The perspective is what''s really effective - it feels like the photographer is cowering in the corner of this inhospitable cellar.</td>', 'I think the feel of the place comes across very well - institutional and very bleak indeed.  The perspective is what''s really effective - it feels like the photographer is cowering in the corner of this inhospitable cellar.', '2007-09-17 14:41:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096672, 580860, 61651, '<td valign="top">You made the birds seem at one with their environment, which of course these excellent seabirds are.  Nice light on the foreground water.</td>', 'You made the birds seem at one with their environment, which of course these excellent seabirds are.  Nice light on the foreground water.', '2007-09-17 14:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096677, 582921, 61651, '<td valign="top">This one absolutely fits the bill - those reflections/ripples are wild.  And the composition is great - the lily pads just sort of come and go through the frame, they don''t dominate.</td>', 'This one absolutely fits the bill - those reflections/ripples are wild.  And the composition is great - the lily pads just sort of come and go through the frame, they don''t dominate.', '2007-09-17 14:45:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096680, 579837, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and colorful!</td>', 'Very pretty and colorful!', '2007-09-17 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096712, 581617, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nothing like a fog rolling in to help make things all impressionistic - I think this is a very calming and pretty shot, and suits the challenge, but I find myself wishing there were a bit more free space in the composition, a bit more breathing room especially at the top.</td>', 'Nothing like a fog rolling in to help make things all impressionistic - I think this is a very calming and pretty shot, and suits the challenge, but I find myself wishing there were a bit more free space in the composition, a bit more breathing room especially at the top.', '2007-09-17 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096716, 583342, 61651, '<td valign="top">This definitely has a painting feel to it and the light is gorgeous and plays over the entire range of the image - this shot has nice depth.</td>', 'This definitely has a painting feel to it and the light is gorgeous and plays over the entire range of the image - this shot has nice depth.', '2007-09-17 14:59:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096725, 582922, 61651, '<td valign="top">A lovely mix of well-lit colors in that background - suitably impressionistic.</td>', 'A lovely mix of well-lit colors in that background - suitably impressionistic.', '2007-09-17 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096736, 583249, 61651, '<td valign="top">You put so much effort into this, I''m impressed and I''d venture to say Van Gogh would be envious. :)  I see the pots now, when I didn''t before - this is really quite good - the brushes and added flower make interpreting the image (without having read the description beforehand) a bit confusing, but I see that you wanted to cover up the hole - maybe you could have covered the hole with a bit of cardboard and painted over it?</td>', 'You put so much effort into this, I''m impressed and I''d venture to say Van Gogh would be envious. :)  I see the pots now, when I didn''t before - this is really quite good - the brushes and added flower make interpreting the image (without having read the description beforehand) a bit confusing, but I see that you wanted to cover up the hole - maybe you could have covered the hole with a bit of cardboard and painted over it?', '2007-09-17 15:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096738, 583236, 61651, '<td valign="top">Wow - actually looks like it''s painted on canvas.  Nice impressionism, although I''ll admit the first thing I thought of when viewing this was "Vermeer" who is decidedly not Impressionism, but a master of light nevertheless.  This honestly looks like a detail from a Vermeer.</td>', 'Wow - actually looks like it''s painted on canvas.  Nice impressionism, although I''ll admit the first thing I thought of when viewing this was "Vermeer" who is decidedly not Impressionism, but a master of light nevertheless.  This honestly looks like a detail from a Vermeer.', '2007-09-17 15:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096739, 583251, 61651, '<td valign="top">Yeah, herons are hard - easily spooked.  I gave this a 10, as I thought the quality of light you captured here was just outstanding.</td>', 'Yeah, herons are hard - easily spooked.  I gave this a 10, as I thought the quality of light you captured here was just outstanding.', '2007-09-17 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096744, 583086, 61651, '<td valign="top">Fantastically successful execution of your idea - looks very much like Morisot.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon!</td>', 'Fantastically successful execution of your idea - looks very much like Morisot.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon!', '2007-09-17 15:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096753, 582957, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture - the way the motion expresses the light here is fantastic.</td>', 'Beautiful capture - the way the motion expresses the light here is fantastic.', '2007-09-17 15:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096756, 581023, 61651, '<td valign="top">Magical lighting, would love to know how you processed this.  I gave it a 9 and thought the composition was great.  Can''t understand why some don''t like the back boat, IMO it *needs* to be there.</td>', 'Magical lighting, would love to know how you processed this.  I gave it a 9 and thought the composition was great.  Can''t understand why some don''t like the back boat, IMO it *needs* to be there.', '2007-09-17 15:18:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096763, 583272, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful spread of color and fits the bill for the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful spread of color and fits the bill for the challenge!', '2007-09-17 15:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096765, 583087, 61651, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very interesting treatment and gave it an 8 - a very different take on what "impressionism" is, not quite what I was expecting, but very welcome to see.</td>', 'I thought this was a very interesting treatment and gave it an 8 - a very different take on what "impressionism" is, not quite what I was expecting, but very welcome to see.', '2007-09-17 15:24:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096766, 582245, 61651, '<td valign="top">A spirited spray of color - nice brushstroke effect.</td>', 'A spirited spray of color - nice brushstroke effect.', '2007-09-17 15:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096770, 580684, 61651, '<td valign="top">I thought "Italy" when I saw this during voting. :)  This shot makes me feel the heat of the sun on my neck - really a superb impressionism treatment.</td>', 'I thought "Italy" when I saw this during voting. :)  This shot makes me feel the heat of the sun on my neck - really a superb impressionism treatment.', '2007-09-17 15:26:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096776, 583124, 61651, '<td valign="top">Quiet and unassuming - very nice.</td>', 'Quiet and unassuming - very nice.', '2007-09-17 15:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096786, 582619, 61651, '<td valign="top">Looks like a partial pencil drawing, with colors painted in - beautiful impressionistic rendering.</td>', 'Looks like a partial pencil drawing, with colors painted in - beautiful impressionistic rendering.', '2007-09-17 15:36:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096789, 582531, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice painted effect - a very appealing composition.</td>', 'Nice painted effect - a very appealing composition.', '2007-09-17 15:37:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096793, 581735, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very nice technique. I love the slight pan and the effect it created. Wonderful lighting. Almost feels like being there. Hey, I was 1 of your 2 eights.</td>', 'Very nice technique. I love the slight pan and the effect it created. Wonderful lighting. Almost feels like being there. Hey, I was 1 of your 2 eights.', '2007-09-17 15:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096795, 582847, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very nice energy to this - I like how the composition is broken out into 3 sections/layers.</td>', 'Very nice energy to this - I like how the composition is broken out into 3 sections/layers.', '2007-09-17 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096796, 582682, 61651, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really good here - has that early morning/working in the fields look.</td>', 'The lighting is really good here - has that early morning/working in the fields look.', '2007-09-17 15:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096802, 580029, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice broad expanse to this composition - and especially like the inclusion of the lone beach walker.</td>', 'Nice broad expanse to this composition - and especially like the inclusion of the lone beach walker.', '2007-09-17 15:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096815, 581300, 61651, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous still life - like a Dutch Master.  Artful and painterly.  Not so "impressionistic" in my opinion, but a stunning achievement that you have every reason to be proud of.</td>', 'Gorgeous still life - like a Dutch Master.  Artful and painterly.  Not so "impressionistic" in my opinion, but a stunning achievement that you have every reason to be proud of.', '2007-09-17 15:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096820, 580875, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, uncomplicated and soothing.</td>', 'Nice shot, uncomplicated and soothing.', '2007-09-17 15:46:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4096822, 582092, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and delicate - nice job with the lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful and delicate - nice job with the lighting.', '2007-09-17 15:47:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097262, 583086, 56999, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your Blue and a wonderful image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your Blue and a wonderful image.', '2007-09-17 18:49:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097270, 582956, 56999, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this extrordinary image I''m sure will inspire many more of it''s likeness in the future.</td>', 'Congratulations on this extrordinary image I''m sure will inspire many more of it''s likeness in the future.', '2007-09-17 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097273, 582704, 56999, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your finish and such a beautiful image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your finish and such a beautiful image.', '2007-09-17 18:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097275, 581300, 56999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image and congratulations on your finish.</td>', 'Wonderful image and congratulations on your finish.', '2007-09-17 18:55:37.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4097277, 583204, 56999, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your finish. Beautifully conceived and executed.</td>', 'Congratulations on your finish. Beautifully conceived and executed.', '2007-09-17 18:58:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097280, 582251, 56999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, well done. Congratulations on your finish</td>', 'Wonderful image, well done. Congratulations on your finish', '2007-09-17 19:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097283, 583232, 56999, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your finish and beautiful image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your finish and beautiful image.', '2007-09-17 19:03:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097285, 580875, 56999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones. Congratulations on the image and your finish.</td>', 'Beautiful tones. Congratulations on the image and your finish.', '2007-09-17 19:04:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097292, 583005, 56999, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your beautiful image and finish.</td>', 'Congratulations on your beautiful image and finish.', '2007-09-17 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4097642, 583314, 66597, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites of the challenge - I expected it would ribbon, in fact. Congrats on the top ten, though! Very well done.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites of the challenge - I expected it would ribbon, in fact. Congrats on the top ten, though! Very well done.', '2007-09-17 22:05:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098516, 579837, 48228, '<td valign="top">What a colorful and bright image here. I love the freshness and the strong blend of colors.</td>', 'What a colorful and bright image here. I love the freshness and the strong blend of colors.', '2007-09-18 09:26:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098699, 583333, 30508, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Neil.  You should have saved this for a Free Study, though.  It would have been far more appreciated by the voters there.</td>', 'Beautiful, Neil.  You should have saved this for a Free Study, though.  It would have been far more appreciated by the voters there.', '2007-09-18 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098969, 582821, 62318, '<td valign="top">I loved the fact this was done al''naturale. Very cool scene and the color pallette is amazing.</td>', 'I loved the fact this was done al''naturale. Very cool scene and the color pallette is amazing.', '2007-09-18 13:41:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4098981, 582084, 62318, '<td valign="top">The lighting and contrast on this capture is extraordinary. I also love how it tells a story about your personal experiences. a terrific shot (gave you a 7 during the challenge).</td>', 'The lighting and contrast on this capture is extraordinary. I also love how it tells a story about your personal experiences. a terrific shot (gave you a 7 during the challenge).', '2007-09-18 13:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4099141, 582821, 30508, '<td valign="top">This is stunning, and way underrated.  You''ve achieved a lovely watercolor effect that fits the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'This is stunning, and way underrated.  You''ve achieved a lovely watercolor effect that fits the challenge perfectly.', '2007-09-18 15:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4099251, 582956, 32997, '<td valign="top">a thoughtful, well executed take on the challenge...congrats on the ribbon...</td>', 'a thoughtful, well executed take on the challenge...congrats on the ribbon...', '2007-09-18 16:33:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4099752, 581096, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  Not to good at PS, so I tried another trick.  Learned a bit more on this challenge than most.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-19 13:28:56.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  Not to good at PS, so I tried another trick.  Learned a bit more on this challenge than most.', '2007-09-18 20:55:53.000000', '2007-09-19 14:28:56.000000', 0),
(4099757, 582084, 51269, '<td valign="top">Tells a story- bleak is right- I feel very fortunate to be in my cozy home.... stay safe-Patio</td>', 'Tells a story- bleak is right- I feel very fortunate to be in my cozy home.... stay safe-Patio', '2007-09-18 20:56:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4099980, 583342, 62318, '<td valign="top">I have a very similar garden photo, but mine missed the deadline as a day early. Those this one has a bit more vibrancy. Terrific style for this challenge.</td>', 'I have a very similar garden photo, but mine missed the deadline as a day early. Those this one has a bit more vibrancy. Terrific style for this challenge.', '2007-09-18 22:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100016, 583231, 53572, '<td valign="top">lovely lensbaby.</td>', 'lovely lensbaby.', '2007-09-18 23:05:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100028, 581106, 53572, '<td valign="top">grossly underrated.  a lovely shot - well done.</td>', 'grossly underrated.  a lovely shot - well done.', '2007-09-18 23:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100800, 583204, 63398, '<td valign="top">Well done, Catherine! Congrats on an outstanding finish!</td>', 'Well done, Catherine! Congrats on an outstanding finish!', '2007-09-19 03:33:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100978, 583086, 66799, '<td valign="top">amazing how from the similar takes one is to be chosen, and chosen right,<br/>thanks, I''ve learn from you</td>', 'amazing how from the similar takes one is to be chosen, and chosen right,thanks, I''ve learn from you', '2007-09-19 06:18:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4100979, 582956, 66799, '<td valign="top">gorgeous,but the blue background behind the petals distructing attention</td>', 'gorgeous,but the blue background behind the petals distructing attention', '2007-09-19 06:20:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4101066, 582956, 52628, '<td valign="top">Ohhh.  This shot should clearly have won!  Great idea and well executed.</td>', 'Ohhh.  This shot should clearly have won!  Great idea and well executed.', '2007-09-19 07:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4101281, 581300, 49716, '<td valign="top">Really nice work!  I''ve done something similar that I am pretty happy with, but I think your attempt is even better.  Well Done.</td>', 'Really nice work!  I''ve done something similar that I am pretty happy with, but I think your attempt is even better.  Well Done.', '2007-09-19 09:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4103221, 583341, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is one where I really would like to have seen it in focus.  Yes, I know that does not apply to the challenge, but those look like some very pretty flowers!</td>', 'This is one where I really would like to have seen it in focus.  Yes, I know that does not apply to the challenge, but those look like some very pretty flowers!', '2007-09-19 22:01:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4105042, 582425, 84405, '<td valign="top">The colours in this is insane.Very beautiful!</td>', 'The colours in this is insane.Very beautiful!', '2007-09-20 15:21:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4105778, 583086, 64446, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue! Beautiful image! And the outtakes are great too!<br/>You''ve been in a roll my friend... just keep it coming...</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue! Beautiful image! And the outtakes are great too!You''ve been in a roll my friend... just keep it coming...', '2007-09-20 21:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4106874, 581382, 14986, '<td valign="top">I love how you''ve simply captured the feel of the carnival in the composition.   Very nice!</td>', 'I love how you''ve simply captured the feel of the carnival in the composition.   Very nice!', '2007-09-21 12:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4107464, 583111, 66709, '<td valign="top">great picture  Is the dog on a leash?</td>', 'great picture  Is the dog on a leash?', '2007-09-21 17:56:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4107603, 579810, 57229, '<td valign="top">Thia is an astonishing capture. And it''s all about the light! I can see the point about less of the bottom bit and maybe a bit more of what isn''t in the picture at the top. All that gets you is a longer yellow stripe though...<br/>Keep on... :)</td>', 'Thia is an astonishing capture. And it''s all about the light! I can see the point about less of the bottom bit and maybe a bit more of what isn''t in the picture at the top. All that gets you is a longer yellow stripe though...Keep on... :)', '2007-09-21 19:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4111100, 583306, 27133, '<td valign="top">Hey...very pretty!</td>', 'Hey...very pretty!', '2007-09-23 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4113142, 583200, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice sectioning of color groups moving back through the frame.  The bright bit of dirt in the front left distracts a bit, maybe crop out a teeny bit off the bottom?  The most impressionistic looking part, to me, is that strip of whites and reds - the background greenery looks almost pontillistic.</td>', 'Nice sectioning of color groups moving back through the frame.  The bright bit of dirt in the front left distracts a bit, maybe crop out a teeny bit off the bottom?  The most impressionistic looking part, to me, is that strip of whites and reds - the background greenery looks almost pontillistic.', '2007-09-24 19:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4113965, 583249, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think the brushes and the flower work well here to show that this is indeed a photograph and not something created with photoshop.  Lovely, vibrant colors give this a very nice sense of life!</td>', 'I think the brushes and the flower work well here to show that this is indeed a photograph and not something created with photoshop.  Lovely, vibrant colors give this a very nice sense of life!', '2007-09-25 03:29:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4114024, 583249, 674, '<td valign="top">Hi<br/>I was away during the impression challenge so couldn''t vote, but would have given this a 9!</td>', 'HiI was away during the impression challenge so couldn''t vote, but would have given this a 9!', '2007-09-25 06:18:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4114898, 582084, 16241, '<td valign="top">looks like you''re not the only one that likes this!<br/>great shot, shem you really slept there..</td>', 'looks like you''re not the only one that likes this!great shot, shem you really slept there..', '2007-09-25 16:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4119443, 583272, 56954, '<td valign="top">Congrats. I love the painterly approach to this beautifully composed and colored composition.</td>', 'Congrats. I love the painterly approach to this beautifully composed and colored composition.', '2007-09-27 03:16:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4121589, 583333, 14620, '<td valign="top">Yes, you''re right.  That adds a very pleasing effect.  And those colors are so lovely together.</td>', 'Yes, you''re right.  That adds a very pleasing effect.  And those colors are so lovely together.', '2007-09-28 01:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4121875, 581300, 25355, '<td valign="top">This indeed is very much like a real painting. Great effort, Mak. The only thing that doesn''t quite ring true as a painting is the quality of the reflected light on the vase.<br/>  You should check out <a href="//photo.net/photodb/folder?folder_id=657830" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this gal''s </a> folder; she was featured in Popular Photo magazine, Oct 07 (I saw it today in the library, and thought of your photo here...)</td>', 'This indeed is very much like a real painting. Great effort, Mak. The only thing that doesn''t quite ring true as a painting is the quality of the reflected light on the vase.  You should check out this gal''s  folder; she was featured in Popular Photo magazine, Oct 07 (I saw it today in the library, and thought of your photo here...)', '2007-09-28 08:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
